msgid "PAO-based local correlation treatments"
msgstr "基于投影原子轨道的局域相关处理"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid ""
"The PAO based local correlation program of Molpro can currently perform "
"closed-shell LMP2, LMP3, LMP4(SDTQ), LCISD, LDCSD, LQCISD(T), and LCCSD(T) "
"calculations. For large molecules, all methods scale linearly with molecular"
" size, provided very distant pairs are neglected, and the integral-direct "
"algorithms are used."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 的基于投影原子轨道的局域相关程序目前可以执行闭壳层 LMP2、LMP3、LMP4(SDTQ)、LCISD、LDCSD、LQCISD(T) "
"和 LCCSD(T) 计算。对于大分子，只要忽略极远对并使用积分直接算法，所有方法均随分子尺寸线性标度。"

msgid ""
"Much higher efficiency is achieved by using density fitting (DF) "
"approximations to compute the integrals. Density fitting is available for "
"all local methods up to LCCSD(T), as well as for analytical LMP2 gradients. "
"Only iterative triples methods like LCCSDT-1b can currently not be done with"
" density fitting."
msgstr ""
"通过使用密度拟合 (DF) 近似来计算积分，可以获得更高的效率。密度拟合可用于所有直至 LCCSD(T) 的局域方法，以及解析的 LMP2 "
"梯度。目前只有像 LCCSDT-1b 这样的迭代三重激发方法无法使用密度拟合。"

msgid ""
"The errors introduced by DF are negligible, and the use of the DF methods is"
" highly recommended. Linear scaling can be obtained in DF-LMP2 using the "
"``LOCFIT`` option (see Ref. 11); in DF-LCCSD(T), the most important parts "
"also scale linearly, but some transformation steps scale quadratically."
msgstr ""
"DF 引入的误差可以忽略不计，强烈建议使用 DF 方法。在 DF-LMP2 中，使用 ``LOCFIT`` 选项可以获得线性标度（参见文献 11）；在 "
"DF-LCCSD(T) 中，最重要的部分也是线性标度，但某些变换步骤是二次标度。"

msgid ""
"Energy gradients are available for LMP2, DF-LMP2, DF-SCS-LMP2, and LQCISD "
"(in the latter case only for ``LOCAL=1``, i.e. the local calculation is "
"simulated using the canonical program, and savings only result from the "
"reduced number of pairs)."
msgstr ""
"能量梯度可用于 LMP2、DF-LMP2、DF-SCS-LMP2 和 LQCISD（对于后者，仅适用于 ``LOCAL=1``\\ "
"，即使用正则程序模拟局域计算，节省的计算量仅来自减少的对数）。"

msgid ""
"Before using these methods, it is strongly recommended to read the "
"literature in order to understand the basic concepts and approximations. A "
"recent review [1] and Ref. [2] may be suitable for an introduction."
msgstr "在使用这些方法之前，强烈建议阅读相关文献以理解基本概念和近似。一篇近期的综述 [1] 和参考文献 [2] 可能适合作为入门。"

msgid "References:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "入门指南"

msgid ""
"The local correlation treatment is switched on by preceding the command name"
" by an ``L``, i.e., by using the ``LMP2``, ``LMP3``, ``LMP4``, ``LQCISD``, "
"``LCCSD``, ``LDCSD``, or ``LCISD`` commands."
msgstr ""
"通过在命令名称前加上 ``L`` 来开启局域相关处理，即使用 ``LMP2``\\ 、\\ ``LMP3``\\ 、\\ ``LMP4``\\ 、\\ "
"``LQCISD``\\ 、\\ ``LCCSD``\\ 、\\ ``LDCSD`` 或 ``LCISD`` 命令。"

msgid ""
"The ``LQCISD`` and ``LCCSD`` commands can be appended by a specification for"
" the perturbative treatment of triple excitations (e.g., ``LCCSD(T0)``):"
msgstr "``LQCISD`` 和 ``LCCSD`` 命令可以附加一个用于微扰处理三重激发的说明（例如 ``LCCSD(T0)``\\ ）："

msgid "``(T)`` Use the default triples method. Currently this is T0."
msgstr "``(T)`` 使用默认的三重态方法。目前是 T0。"

msgid ""
"``(T0)`` Non-iterative local triples. This is the fastest triples option. It"
" is usually sufficiently accurate and recommended to be used in most cases."
msgstr "``(T0)`` 非迭代局域三重态。这是最快的三重态选项。通常足够精确，建议在大多数情况下使用。"

msgid ""
"``(T1)`` T0 plus one perturbative update of the triples amplitudes. If the "
"accuracy of T0 is insufficient (very rarely the case!), this can be used to "
"improve the accuracy. The computational cost is at least twice as large as "
"for T0. In contrast to T0, the triples amplitudes must be stored on disk, "
"which can be a bottleneck in calculations for large molecules. Also the "
"memory requirements are substantially larger than for T0."
msgstr ""
"``(T1)`` T0 加上对三重激发振幅的一次微扰更新。如果 T0 的精度不足（这种情况非常罕见！），可以使用此选项来提高精度。计算成本至少是 T0 "
"的两倍。与 T0 不同，三重激发振幅必须存储在磁盘上，这可能是大分子计算的瓶颈。此外，内存需求也明显大于 T0。"

msgid ""
"``(T1C)`` As T1, but a caching algorithm is used which avoids the "
"simultaneous storage of all triples amplitudes on disk (as is the case for "
"``(T1)`` or ``(TF)``). Hence, T1C requires less disk space but more CPU-time"
" than T1. The more disk space is made available for the caching algorithm "
"(using the T1DISK option on the local card, see below), the less CPU time is"
" used."
msgstr ""
"``(T1C)`` 与 T1 类似，但使用了缓存算法，避免了所有三重激发振幅同时存储在磁盘上（如 ``(T1)`` 或 ``(TF)`` "
"的情况）。因此，与 T1 相比，T1C 需要更少的磁盘空间但更多的 CPU 时间。为缓存算法提供的磁盘空间越多（使用 local 卡片上的 T1DISK"
" 选项，见下文），使用的 CPU 时间就越少。"

msgid ""
"``(TF)`` Full iterative triples calculation. With full domains and without "
"weak pair approximations this gives the same result as a canonical (T) "
"calculation. Typically, 3-5 iterations are needed, and therefore the "
"computational effort is 2-3 times larger than for (T1). The disk and memory "
"requirements are the same as for T1. The T0 energy is also computed and "
"printed. ``TFULL`` and ``FULL`` are aliases for ``TF``."
msgstr ""
"``(TF)`` 完全迭代的三重激发计算。使用完全域且无弱对近似时，其结果与正则 (T) 计算相同。通常需要 3-5 次迭代，因此计算量是 (T1) 的"
" 2-3 倍。磁盘和内存需求与 T1 相同。T0 能量也会被计算并打印出来。\\ ``TFULL`` 和 ``FULL`` 是 ``TF`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"``(TA)`` As TF, but the T1 energy is also computed. Since the first "
"iteration is different for T1, the convergence of the triples iterations is "
"slightly different with TF and TA (TF being somewhat faster in most cases). "
"``TALL`` and ``ALL`` are aliases for ``TA``."
msgstr ""
"``(TA)`` 与 TF 类似，但 T1 能量也会被计算。由于 T1 的第一次迭代不同，三重激发迭代的收敛性在 TF 和 TA "
"之间略有不同（在大多数情况下 TF 稍快一些）。\\ ``TALL`` 和 ``ALL`` 是 ``TA`` 的别名。"

msgid ""
"The general input for local coupled LMP2 or coupled cluster calculations is:"
msgstr "局域耦合 LMP2 或耦合簇计算的通用输入格式为："

msgid ""
"The same options as on the command line can also be given on subsequent "
"``LOCAL`` and ``MULTP`` directives. Instead of using the ``MULTP`` "
"directive, the ``MULTP`` option on the command line can also be used."
msgstr ""
"命令行上的相同选项也可以在后续的 ``LOCAL`` 和 ``MULTP`` 指令中给出。除了使用 ``MULTP`` 指令，也可以使用命令行上的 "
"``MULTP`` 选项。"

msgid ""
"In the following, we will first give a summary of all options and "
"directives. These will be described in more detail in the subsequent "
"sections. For new users it is recommended to read section `doing it right "
"<pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#doing-it-right>`__ at the end "
"of this chapter before starting calculations."
msgstr ""
"接下来，我们将首先给出所有选项和指令的概述。这些将在后续章节中更详细地描述。对于新用户，建议在开始计算之前阅读本章末尾的 `正确操作 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#doing-it-right>`__ 一节。"

msgid "Summary of options"
msgstr "选项概述"

msgid ""
"Many options can be specified on the command line. For all options "
"appropriate default values are set, and so these options must usually be "
"modified only for special purposes. For convenience and historical reasons, "
"alias names are available for various options, which often correspond to the"
" variable name used in the program. The following table summarizes the "
"options, aliases and default values. In the following, the parameters will "
"be described in more detail."
msgstr ""
"许多选项可以在命令行上指定。所有选项都设置了适当的默认值，因此这些选项通常仅在特殊用途时才需要修改。为了方便和历史原因，各种选项都有可用的别名，这些别名通常对应于程序中使用的变量名。下表总结了选项、别名和默认值。接下来，将更详细地描述这些参数。"

