msgid "Threshold for eliminating projected orbitals with small norm."
msgstr "用于消除小范数投影轨道的阈值。"

msgid "``THRLOC``"
msgstr "``THRLOC``"

msgid "Threshold for eliminating redundant projected orbitals."
msgstr "用于消除冗余投影轨道的阈值。"

msgid "``THRCOR``"
msgstr "``THRCOR``"

msgid "1.d-1"
msgstr "1.d-1"

msgid "Threshold for eliminating projected core orbitals."
msgstr "用于消除投影芯轨道的阈值。"

msgid "``THRMP2``"
msgstr "``THRMP2``"

msgid "1.d-8"
msgstr "1.d-8"

msgid ""
"Threshold for neglecting small fock matrix elements in the LMP2 iteration."
msgstr "在 LMP2 迭代中忽略小 Fock 矩阵元的阈值。"

msgid "Summary of directives"
msgstr "指令摘要"

msgid ""
"The same standard directives as in the canonical programs, e.g., ``OCC``, "
"``CLOSED``, ``CORE``, ``WF``, ``ORBITAL`` are also valid in the local "
"methods. In addition, there are some directives which only apply to local "
"calculations:"
msgstr ""
"与标准程序相同的标准指令，例如 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED``\\ 、\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``WF``\\ 、\\ "
"``ORBITAL`` 在局部方法中同样有效。此外，还有一些仅适用于局部计算的指令："

msgid ""
"``LOCAL`` Invokes local methods and allows to specify the same options as on"
" the command line."
msgstr "``LOCAL`` 调用局部方法，并允许指定与命令行相同的选项。"

msgid ""
"``MULTP`` As ``LOCAL``, but multipole approximations are used for distant "
"pairs."
msgstr "``MULTP`` 与 ``LOCAL`` 类似，但对远对使用多极近似。"

msgid "``DOMAIN`` Define domains manually (not recommended)."
msgstr "``DOMAIN`` 手动定义域（不推荐）。"

msgid "``MERGEDOM`` Allows to merge domains"
msgstr "``MERGEDOM`` 允许合并域。"

msgid ""
"``REGION`` Allows to select regions of a molecule to be treated at a certain"
" level of theory."
msgstr "``REGION`` 允许选择分子的特定区域以某种理论水平进行处理。"

msgid "``ENEPART`` Analysis of pair energies."
msgstr "``ENEPART`` 对能量进行分析。"

msgid "``SAVE`` Save domains and LCCSD amplitudes."
msgstr "``SAVE`` 保存域和 LCCSD 振幅。"

msgid ""
"``START`` Restart with domains and LCCSD amplitudes from a previous "
"calculation."
msgstr "``START`` 使用先前计算中的域和 LCCSD 振幅重新开始。"

msgid "General Options"
msgstr "通用选项"

msgid ""
"``INTERACT`` Automatically determine individual molecules in a calculation "
"and set appropriate pair lists for computing interaction energies. See "
"section `intermolecular interactions <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__ for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"``INTERACT`` 自动确定计算中的单个分子，并为计算相互作用能设置适当的对列表。详见 `分子间相互作用 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__ 一节。"

msgid "The thresholds can also be specified on the ``THRESH`` directive."
msgstr "阈值也可以在 ``THRESH`` 指令上指定。"

msgid "Options for selection of domains"
msgstr "域选择选项"

msgid ""
"The following sections describe the most important options which affect the "
"domains."
msgstr "以下章节描述了影响域的最重要选项。"

msgid "Standard domains"
msgstr "标准域"

msgid ""
"Standard domains are always determined first. They are used to define "
"strong, close, weak, and distant pairs. More accurate results can be "
"obtained with extended domains, as described in section `extended domains "
"<pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#extended-domains>`__."
msgstr ""
"标准域总是首先被确定。它们用于定义强对、近对、弱对和远对。使用扩展域可以获得更精确的结果，如章节 `扩展域 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#extended-domains>`__ 所述。"

msgid "There are some other options which should normally not be modified:"
msgstr "还有一些其他选项通常不应修改："

msgid ""
"Activates elimination of basis functions corresponding to core orbitals. If "
"*nshell=1*, only :math:`1s`-functions are eliminated from projected space. "
"If *nshell=2* (default) :math:`1s` functions on first-row atoms, and "
":math:`1s`, :math:`2s`, and :math:`2p`-functions are eliminated on second-"
"row atoms. Nothing is eliminated on H or He atoms. If effective core "
"potentials are used, nothing is deleted at the corresponding atom. Also, "
"functions are only deleted if the norm of the projected function is below "
"``THRCOR`` (default 0.1)"
msgstr ""
"激活消除对应于芯轨道的基函数。如果 *nshell=1*\\ ，仅从投影空间中消除 :math:`1s`-函数。如果 *nshell=2*\\ "
"（默认），在第一行原子上消除 :math:`1s` 函数，在第二行原子上消除 :math:`1s`\\ 、\\ :math:`2s` 和 "
":math:`2p`-函数。在 H 或 He 原子上不消除任何函数。如果使用了有效芯势，则在相应原子上不删除任何函数。此外，仅当投影函数的范数低于 "
"``THRCOR``\\ （默认 0.1）时才会删除函数。"

msgid "Extended domains"
msgstr "扩展域"

msgid ""
"There are two alternative modes for domain extensions: either *distance "
"criteria* ``REXT``, ``REXTS``, ``REXTC``, or ``REXTW`` can be used. These "
"are in Bohr and refer to the minimum distance between any atom in a standard"
" orbital domain :math:`[ij]` and another atom. If an atom is found within "
"the given distance, all PAOs at this atom are added to the domain "
":math:`[ij]`. Alternatively, *connectivity criteria* ``IEXT``, ``IEXTS``, "
"``IEXTC``, or ``IEXTW`` can be used. These refer to the number of bonds "
"between any atom contained in the standard domain :math:`[ij]` and another "
"atom. The advantage of distance criteria is that they select also atoms "
"within the given radius which are not connected to the present domain by "
"bonds. On the other hand, the connectivity criteria are independent of "
"different bond lengths, e.g., for first and second-row atoms. Only one of "
"the two possibilities can be used, i.e., they are mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""
"域扩展有两种可选模式：可以使用\\ *距离判据* ``REXT``\\ 、\\ ``REXTS``\\ 、\\ ``REXTC`` 或 "
"``REXTW``\\ 。这些值以玻尔为单位，指的是标准轨道域 :math:`[ij]` "
"中任意原子与另一个原子之间的最小距离。如果在此距离内找到一个原子，则该原子上的所有 PAO 都会被添加到域 :math:`[ij]` "
"中。或者，可以使用\\ *连接性判据* ``IEXT``\\ 、\\ ``IEXTS``\\ 、\\ ``IEXTC`` 或 ``IEXTW``\\ "
"。这些指的是标准域 :math:`[ij]` "
"中包含的任意原子与另一个原子之间的键数。距离判据的优点是，它们还能选择给定半径内与当前域没有键连接的原子。另一方面，连接性判据与不同的键长（例如，第一行和第二行原子）无关。只能使用两种可能性中的一种，即它们是互斥的。"

msgid ""
"By default, domains are not extended, i.e., the default values of all "
"parameters listed above are zero. Note that the pair classes are determined "
"on the basis of the standard domains, and therefore domain extensions have "
"no effect on the pair lists."
msgstr "默认情况下，域不会被扩展，即上述所有参数的默认值均为零。请注意，对儿类别是基于标准域确定的，因此域扩展对配对列表没有影响。"

msgid ""
"Also note that the computational effort increases with the fourth power of "
"the domain sizes and can therefore increase quite dramatically when "
"extending domains. This does not affect the linear scaling behaviour in the "
"asymptotic limit."
msgstr "还需注意，计算量随域大小的四次方增加，因此在扩展域时计算量可能会急剧增加。这不会影响渐近极限下的线性标度行为。"

msgid "Manually Defining orbital domains (DOMAIN)"
msgstr "手动定义轨道域 (DOMAIN)"

msgid ""
"It is possible to define the domains “by hand”, using the ``DOMAIN`` "
"directive:"
msgstr "可以使用 ``DOMAIN`` 指令“手动”定义域："

msgid ""
"where *orbital* has the form ``iorb.isym``, e.g., 3.1 for the third orbital "
"in symmetry 1, and *atomi* are the atomic labels as given in the Z-matrix "
"geometry input, or, alternatively, the Z-matrix row numbers. All basis "
"functions centred at the given atoms are included into the domain. For "
"instance"
msgstr ""
"其中 *orbital* 的形式为 ``iorb.isym``\\ ，例如，3.1 表示对称性 1 中的第三个轨道，而 *atomi* 是 "
"Z-矩阵几何输入中给出的原子标签，或者，也可以是 Z-矩阵行号。所有位于给定原子上的基函数都被包含在域中。例如"

msgid "``DOMAIN,3.1,C1,C2``"
msgstr "``DOMAIN,3.1,C1,C2``"

msgid ""
"defines a domain for a bicentric bond between the carbon atoms ``C1`` and "
"``C2``. The ``DOMAIN`` directive must be given after any ``OCC``, "
"``CLOSED``, or ``CORE`` directives. Note that the order of the localized "
"orbitals depends on the localization procedure, and could even change as "
"function of geometry, and therefore manual ``DOMAIN`` input should be used "
"with great care. The domains of all orbitals which are not explicitly "
"defined using ``DOMAIN`` directive are determined automatically as usual."
msgstr ""
"为碳原子 ``C1`` 和 ``C2`` 之间的双中心键定义了一个域。\\ ``DOMAIN`` 指令必须在任何 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ "
"``CLOSED`` 或 ``CORE`` "
"指令之后给出。请注意，定域轨道的顺序取决于定域化过程，甚至可能随几何结构的变化而改变，因此应非常谨慎地使用手动 ``DOMAIN`` 输入。所有未使用 "
"``DOMAIN`` 指令明确定义的轨道域将像往常一样自动确定。"

msgid "Options for selection of pair classes"
msgstr "对儿类别选择选项"

msgid ""
"There are two alternative modes for defining the pair classes: either "
"*distance criteria* ``RCLOSE``, ``RWEAK``, ``RDIST``, ``RVDIST`` can be "
"used. These are in Bohr and refer for a given orbital pair :math:`(ij)` to "
"the minimum distance :math:`R^{(ij)}` between any atom in the standard "
"orbital domains :math:`[i]` and any atom in the standard orbital domains "
":math:`[j]` . Alternatively, the *connectivity criteria* ``ICLOSE``, "
"``IWEAK``, ``IDIST``, ``IVDIST`` can be used. These refer to the minimum "
"number of bonds between any atom contained in the standard domain "
":math:`[i]` and any atom contained in the standard domain :math:`[j]` The "
"advantage of using connectivity criteria is the independence of the bond "
"lengths, while the advantage of distance criteria (default) is that they are"
" also effective in non-bonding situations. Only one of the two possibilities"
" can be used, i.e., they are mutually exclusive. The use of distance "
"criteria is the default. Using connectivity criteria for pair selection "
"requires to set the option ``USE_DIST=0``."
msgstr ""
"定义对儿类别有两种替代模式：可以使用\\ *距离判据* ``RCLOSE``\\ 、\\ ``RWEAK``\\ 、\\ ``RDIST``\\ 、\\"
" ``RVDIST``\\ 。这些值以玻尔为单位，对于给定的轨道对 :math:`(ij)`\\ ，它们指的是标准轨道域 :math:`[i]` "
"中任意原子与标准轨道域 :math:`[j]` 中任意原子之间的最小距离 :math:`R^{(ij)}`\\ 。或者，可以使用\\ *连通性判据* "
"``ICLOSE``\\ 、\\ ``IWEAK``\\ 、\\ ``IDIST``\\ 、\\ ``IVDIST``\\ 。这些指的是标准域 "
":math:`[i]` 中包含的任意原子与标准域 :math:`[j]` "
"中包含的任意原子之间的最小键数。使用连通性判据的优点是与键长无关，而使用距离判据（默认）的优点是它们在非成键情况下也有效。两种可能性只能使用一种，即它们是互斥的。使用距离判据是默认设置。使用连通性判据进行对儿选择需要设置选项"
" ``USE_DIST=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``USE_DIST`` (default 1) If nonzero, use distance criteria, otherwise "
"connectivity criteria."
msgstr "``USE_DIST``\\ （默认值 1）如果非零，则使用距离判据，否则使用连通性判据。"

msgid ""
"``CHGMIN_PAIRS`` Only atoms in the primary domains are considered for the "
"pair classification if the atomic Löwdin charge is larger than "
"``CHGMIN_PAIRS`` (default value 0.2). This criterion was introduced in order"
" to reduce the dependence of the pair selection on localization tails."
msgstr ""
"``CHGMIN_PAIRS`` 只有当原子的 Löwdin 电荷大于 ``CHGMIN_PAIRS``\\ （默认值 "
"0.2）时，主域中的原子才会被考虑用于对儿分类。引入此判据是为了减少对儿选择对定域化拖尾的依赖性。"

msgid ""
"``RCLOSE`` (default 1) Strong pairs are defined by :math:`0 \\le R^{(ij)} "
"\\lt {\\tt RCLOSE}`. Close pairs are defined by :math:`{\\tt RCLOSE} \\le "
"R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RWEAK}`."
msgstr ""
"``RCLOSE``\\ （默认值 1）强对由 :math:`0 \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RCLOSE}` 定义。近对由 "
":math:`{\\tt RCLOSE} \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RWEAK}` 定义。"

msgid ""
"``RWEAK`` (default 3) Weak pairs are defined by :math:`{\\tt RWEAK} \\le "
"R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RDIST}`."
msgstr "``RWEAK``\\ （默认值 3）弱对由 :math:`{\\tt RWEAK} \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RDIST}` 定义。"

msgid ""
"``RDIST`` (default 8) Distant pairs are defined by :math:`{\\tt RDIST} \\le "
"R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RVDIST}`."
msgstr ""
"``RDIST``\\ （默认值 8）远对由 :math:`{\\tt RDIST} \\le R^{(ij)} \\lt {\\tt RVDIST}`"
" 定义。"

msgid ""
"``RVDIST`` (default 15) Very distant pairs for which :math:`R^{(ij)} \\ge`\\"
" ``RVDIST`` are neglected."
msgstr "``RVDIST``\\ （默认值 15）对于满足 :math:`R^{(ij)} \\ge`\\ ``RVDIST`` 的极远对，将被忽略。"

msgid ""
"``ICLOSE`` (default 1) Strong pairs are separated by less that ``ICLOSE`` "
"bonds. Close orbital pairs are separated by at least ``ICLOSE`` bonds but "
"less than ``IWEAK`` bonds."
msgstr ""
"``ICLOSE``\\ （默认值 1）强对由少于 ``ICLOSE`` 个键分隔。近轨道对由至少 ``ICLOSE`` 个键但少于 ``IWEAK``"
" 个键分隔。"

msgid ""
"``IWEAK`` (default 2) Weak orbital pairs are separated by at least ``IWEAK``"
" bonds but less than ``IDIST`` bonds."
msgstr "``IWEAK``\\ （默认值 2）弱轨道对由至少 ``IWEAK`` 个键但少于 ``IDIST`` 个键分隔。"

msgid ""
"``IDIST`` (default 5) Distant orbital pairs are separated by at least "
"``IDIST`` bonds but less than ``IVDIST`` bonds."
msgstr "``IDIST``\\ （默认值 5）远轨道对由至少 ``IDIST`` 个键但少于 ``IVDIST`` 个键分隔。"

msgid ""
"``IVDIST`` (default 8) Very distant orbital pairs (neglected) are separated "
"by at least ``IVDIST`` bonds."
msgstr "``IVDIST``\\ （默认值 8）极远轨道对（被忽略）由至少 ``IVDIST`` 个键分隔。"

msgid ""
"``KEEPCL`` (default 0) If ``KEEPCL=1``, the LMP2 amplitudes of close pairs "
"are included in the computation of the strong pair LCCSD residuals. If "
"``KEEPCL=2`` all close pairs are fully included in the LCCSD (this does not "
"affect the triples list). This option is not yet implemented as efficiently "
"as it could, and can therefore lead to a significant increase of the CPU "
"time."
msgstr ""
"``KEEPCL``\\ （默认值 0）如果 ``KEEPCL=1``\\ ，则近对的 LMP2 振幅被包含在强对 LCCSD 残差的计算中。如果 "
"``KEEPCL=2``\\ ，则所有近对都完全包含在 LCCSD 中（这不影响三重态列表）。此选项的实现尚未达到其应有的效率，因此可能导致 CPU "
"时间显著增加。"

msgid ""
"Setting ``RCLOSE`` or ``RWEAK`` to zero means that all pairs up to the "
"corresponding class are treated as strong pairs (``RWEAK=0`` implies "
"``RCLOSE=0``). For instance, ``RCLOSE``\\ =0 means that strong and close "
"pairs are fully included in the LCCSD (in this case ``KEEPCL=1`` has no "
"effect). Note, however, that setting ``RCLOSE``\\ =0 increases the length of"
" the triples list. Setting ``RDIST=0`` means that all distant pairs are "
"treated as weak pairs. This does not affect ``RWEAK`` and ``RCLOSE`` and has"
" no effect unless multipole approximations are used for distant pairs. "
"Setting ``RVDIST=0`` means that no very distant pairs are neglected. Again, "
"this has no effect on the other distance parameters."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RCLOSE`` 或 ``RWEAK`` 设置为零意味着直到对应类别的所有对都被视为强对（\\ ``RWEAK=0`` 意味着 "
"``RCLOSE=0``\\ ）。例如，\\ ``RCLOSE``\\ =0 意味着强对和近对完全包含在 LCCSD 中（在这种情况下 "
"``KEEPCL=1`` 无效）。但请注意，设置 ``RCLOSE``\\ =0 会增加三重态列表的长度。设置 ``RDIST=0`` "
"意味着所有远对都被视为弱对。这不影响 ``RWEAK`` 和 ``RCLOSE``\\ ，并且除非对远对使用多极近似，否则没有效果。设置 "
"``RVDIST=0`` 意味着没有极远对被忽略。同样，这对其他距离参数没有影响。"

msgid "Directives"
msgstr "指令"

msgid "The LOCAL directive"
msgstr "LOCAL 指令"

msgid ""
"The ``LOCAL`` directive can be used to specify options for local "
"calculations. If this directive is inside the command block of a local "
"calculation, the options are used only for the current calculation, and this"
" is entirely equivalent as if they were specified on the command line. The "
"``LOCAL`` directive can also be given outside a command block, and in this "
"case the options are used for all subsequent local correlation calculations "
"in the same input."
msgstr ""
"``LOCAL`` 指令可用于指定局域计算选项。若该指令位于局域计算的命令块内，则选项仅用于当前计算，这完全等同于在命令行中指定。\\ "
"``LOCAL`` 指令也可在命令块外给出，此时选项将用于同一输入文件中所有后续的局域相关计算。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "is equivalent to"
msgstr "等价于"

msgid ""
"In the following example the ``LOCAL`` directive is global and acts on all "
"subsequent local calculations, i.e. both calculations will use "
"``THRBP=0.985``"
msgstr "在以下示例中，\\ ``LOCAL`` 指令是全局的，作用于所有后续局域计算，即两个计算都将使用 ``THRBP=0.985``"

msgid "The MULTP directive"
msgstr "MULTP 指令"

msgid ""
"The ``MULTP`` directive turns on the multipole approximations for distant "
"pairs, as described in Ref. [8]. Further options can be given as described "
"above for the ``LOCAL`` directive."
msgstr "``MULTP`` 指令为远对开启多极近似，如文献 [8] 所述。可按照上述 ``LOCAL`` 指令的方式给出更多选项。"

msgid ""
"The level of the multipole approximation can be chosen using option "
"``DSTMLT`` (default 3) ( 1 means dipole approximation, 2 quadrupole "
"approximation and so on)."
msgstr "多极近似的级别可以通过选项 ``DSTMLT`` 来选择（默认值为 3）（1 表示偶极近似，2 表示四极近似，依此类推）。"

msgid ""
"The multipole approximation reduces the computational cost of LMP2 "
"calculations for very large molecules, but leads to some additional errors, "
"see Ref. [8]. It is normally not recommended to be used in coupled-cluster "
"calculations and should never be used for computing intermolecular forces. "
"It can also not be used in geometry optimizations or gradient calculations."
msgstr ""
"多极近似降低了针对超大分子的 LMP2 计算的计算成本，但会引入一些额外的误差，参见文献 "
"[8]。通常不建议在耦合簇计算中使用，并且绝不应用于计算分子间力。它也不能用于几何优化或梯度计算。"

msgid "Saving the wavefunction (SAVE)"
msgstr "保存波函数 (SAVE)"

msgid "The wavefunction can be saved for later restart using"
msgstr "波函数可以通过以下方式保存以供后续重启使用"

msgid ""
"where *record* has the usual form, e.g., 4000.2 means record 4000 on file 2."
" If this directive is given, the domain information as well as the "
"amplitudes are saved (for MPn the amplitudes are not saved). If just the "
"domain information should be stored, the ``SAVE`` option on the ``LOCAL`` "
"directive must be used (cf. section `summary of options <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#summary-of-options>`__)."
msgstr ""
"其中 *record* 具有通常的形式，例如，4000.2 表示文件 2 上的记录 4000。如果给出此指令，则域信息以及振幅将被保存（对于 "
"MPn，振幅不被保存）。如果仅需存储域信息，则必须使用 ``LOCAL`` 指令上的 ``SAVE`` 选项（参见 `选项摘要 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#summary-of-options>`__ 一节）。"

msgid "Restarting a calculation (START)"
msgstr "重启计算 (START)"

msgid "Local CCSD, DCSD or QCISD calculations can be restarted using"
msgstr "局域 CCSD、DCSD 或 QCISD 计算可以通过以下方式重启"

msgid ""
"The record given must have been saved in a previous local calculation using "
"the ``SAVE`` directive (otherwise this directive is ignored). If the "
"``START`` directive is given, the domain information as well as the "
"amplitudes of the previous calculation are used for restart. It is possible,"
" for instance, to start a local CCSD calculation with the amplitudes "
"previously saved for a local QCISD calculation (but of course it is not "
"possible to use a record saved for a non-local CCSD or QCISD calculation). "
"If it is intended only to use the domain information but not the amplitudes "
"for a restart, the ``START`` option on the command line or ``LOCAL`` "
"directive must be used (cf. section `summary of options <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#summary-of-options>`__)."
msgstr ""
"给定的记录必须已通过先前的局域计算使用 ``SAVE`` 指令保存（否则该指令将被忽略）。如果给出了 ``START`` "
"指令，则先前计算的域信息以及振幅将被用于重启。例如，可以使用先前为局域 QCISD 计算保存的振幅来启动局域 CCSD 计算（但当然不能使用为非局域 "
"CCSD 或 QCISD 计算保存的记录）。如果仅打算使用域信息而不使用振幅进行重启，则必须使用命令行或 ``LOCAL`` 指令上的 "
"``START`` 选项（参见 `选项摘要 <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#summary-"
"of-options>`__ 一节）。"

msgid "Correlating subsets of electrons (REGION)"
msgstr "关联电子子集 (REGION)"

msgid ""
"In large molecules, it may be sufficient to correlate only the electrons in "
"the vicinity of an *active group*, and to treat the rest of the molecule at "
"the SCF level. This approach can even be extended, different correlation "
"levels may be used for different sections of the system. The ``REGION`` "
"directive allows the specification of a subset of atoms:"
msgstr ""
"在大分子中，可能只需关联 *活性基团* 附近的电子，而将分子的其余部分在 SCF "
"水平处理。这种方法甚至可以扩展，系统的不同部分可以使用不同的相关水平。\\ ``REGION`` 指令允许指定一个原子子集："

msgid ""
"The orbitals located at these atoms will be treated at the level specified "
"in *method*. The remaining orbitals will be treated as defined in *default*."
" If not given by the user, the latter option will be set to ``HF``."
msgstr ""
"位于这些原子上的轨道将按照 *method* 指定的水平处理。剩余的轨道将按照 *default* 定义的方式处理。如果用户未指定，后一个选项将设置为 "
"``HF``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The orbital selection can be done in two ways. If *type* is set to "
"``INCLUSIVE``, any orbital containing one of the atoms in its domain centre "
"list will be included. If type is set to ``EXCLUSIVE``, the program will "
"only add orbitals whose domains are exclusively covered by the given atoms. "
"Any local correlation treatment can be given as *method*, with the "
"restriction that only ``MP2`` and ``HF`` can be used as *default_method*. Up"
" to two ``REGION`` directives may be included in a single calculation, "
"ordered according to the correlation level (*method*) specified for the "
"region. The highest level region should be given last."
msgstr ""
"轨道选择可以通过两种方式进行。如果 *type* 设置为 ``INCLUSIVE``\\ ，则任何在其域中心列表中包含给定原子之一的轨道都将被包含。如果"
" *type* 设置为 ``EXCLUSIVE``\\ ，程序将仅添加那些域完全由给定原子覆盖的轨道。任何局域相关处理都可以作为 *method* "
"给出，但限制是只有 ``MP2`` 和 ``HF`` 可以用作 *default_method*\\ 。单个计算中最多可以包含两个 ``REGION``"
" 指令，根据为区域指定的相关水平 (*method*) 排序。最高水平的区域应最后给出。"

msgid ""
"It is advisable to check the region orbital list and the orbital domains "
"printed by the program. The use of regions may significantly reduce the "
"computation time, and, provided the active atoms are sensibly chosen, may "
"give still sufficiently accurate results for the *active group*, e.g. bond "
"lengths and bond angles."
msgstr ""
"建议检查程序打印的区域轨道列表和轨道域。使用区域可以显著减少计算时间，并且，只要活性原子选择得当，仍可为 *活性基团*\\ "
"（例如键长和键角）提供足够准确的结果。"

msgid "Domain Merging (MERGEDOM)"
msgstr "域合并 (MERGEDOM)"

msgid ""
"The restriction of the virtual space in local calculations may result in "
"discontinuities for reaction path calculations due to changes of the "
"geometry dependent domains. This may be avoided by the use of a ``MERGEDOM``"
" directive"
msgstr "局域计算中虚空间的限制可能由于几何依赖的域的变化而导致反应路径计算的不连续性。这可以通过使用 ``MERGEDOM`` 指令来避免"

msgid ""
"This directive provides augmented domains, which can be saved (using option "
"or directive ``SAVE``, see section `saving the wavefunction (SAVE) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#saving-the-wavefunction-save>`__) "
"for later use in reaction paths or in single point calculations (in cases "
"where the orbital domain description is unbalanced). The use of the "
"*neighbour* option works in the same way as the local option ``MERGEDOM``, "
"with *value* specifying the number of coincident centres. If the *centres* "
"option is used, an atom list should be given (enclosed by square brackets). "
"The domains of all orbitals located exclusively at these atoms will be "
"merged, and the resulting merged domains will be used for all these "
"orbitals."
msgstr ""
"该指令提供增强的域，这些域可以被保存（使用选项或指令 ``SAVE``\\ ，参见章节 `保存波函数 (SAVE) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#saving-the-wavefunction-save>`__\\ "
"）以供后续在反应路径或单点计算中使用（在轨道域描述不平衡的情况下）。\\ *neighbour* 选项的使用方式与局域选项 ``MERGEDOM`` "
"相同，其中 *值* 指定了重合中心的数量。如果使用了 *centres* "
"选项，则应提供一个原子列表（用方括号括起来）。所有仅位于这些原子上的轨道域将被合并，并且生成的合并域将用于所有这些轨道。"

msgid ""
"One may also give a *record* number from a previously saved local "
"calculation. The domain list contained in the record will be matched to the "
"current one, and orbital domains augmented (merged) to include both sets. "
"This domain definition should then be adequate for calculations on both "
"points (and all those in between). This procedure can be repeated to include"
" more geometries. In this way domains can be defined that are appropriate "
"for a whole range of geometries (e.g. a reaction path), and if these domains"
" are used in all calculations a strictly smooth potential energy surface is "
"obtained."
msgstr ""
"也可以提供一个先前保存的局域计算的 *record* "
"编号。记录中包含的域列表将与当前列表进行匹配，并且轨道域将被增强（合并）以包含两组域。然后，该域定义应足以用于两个点（以及它们之间的所有点）的计算。此过程可以重复进行以包含更多几何构型。通过这种方式，可以定义适用于整个几何构型范围（例如，一个反应路径）的域，并且如果这些域在所有计算中都得到使用，则可以得到严格光滑的势能面。"

msgid "Energy partitioning for molecular cluster calculations (ENEPART)"
msgstr "分子簇计算的能量划分 (ENEPART)"

msgid ""
"The local character of occupied and virtual orbitals in the local "
"correlation treatment also offers the appealing possibility to decompose the"
" intermolecular interaction energy of molecular clusters into individual "
"contributions of different excitation classes. This allows to distinguish "
"between intramolecular-, dispersive-, and ionic components of the "
"correlation contribution to the interaction energy (cf. M. Schütz, G. Rauhut"
" and H.J. Werner, J. Phys. Chem. **102**, 5197 (1998)). The energy "
"partitioning algorithm is activated either by supplying the ``ENEPART`` "
"directive:"
msgstr ""
"局域相关处理中占据轨道和虚轨道的局域特性也提供了一个吸引人的可能性，即将分子簇的分子间相互作用能分解为不同激发类别的个体贡献。这使得可以区分相互作用能的相关贡献中的分子内、色散和离子成分（参见"
" M. Schütz, G. Rauhut 和 H.J. Werner, J. Phys. Chem. **102**, 5197 "
"(1998)）。能量划分算法通过提供 ``ENEPART`` 指令来激活："

msgid "or by giving the parameters as options on the command line."
msgstr "或者通过在命令行上以选项形式给出参数。"

msgid ""
"The *epart* parameter determines the cutoff distance for (intramolecular) "
"bond lengths (in a.u., default 3 a.u.) and is used to automatically "
"determine the individual monomer subunits of the cluster. The *iepart* "
"parameter enables the energy partitioning, if set to a value larger than "
"zero (default 1). Additionally, if iepart is set to 2, a list of all "
"intermolecular pair energies and their components is printed."
msgstr ""
"*epart* 参数决定了（分子内）键长的截断距离（以原子单位计，默认为 3 a.u.），并用于自动确定团簇的各个单体亚单元。\\ *iepart* "
"参数用于启用能量划分，如果其值大于零（默认为 1）。此外，如果 iepart 设置为 2，则会打印所有分子间对能量及其分量的列表。"

msgid ""
"The output section produced by the energy partitioning algorithm will look "
"similar to the following example:"
msgstr "能量划分算法产生的输出部分将类似于以下示例："

msgid ""
"The centre groups correspond to the individual monomers determined for "
"*epart=3*. In the present example, two water monomers were found. The "
"correlation energy is partitioned into the four components shown above. The "
"exchange dispersion, dispersion and ionic components reflect directly the "
"related intermolecular components of the complex, while the intramolecular "
"correlation contribution to the interaction energy has to be determined by a"
" super-molecular calculation, i.e. by subtracting the (two) corresponding "
"monomer correlation energies from the intramolecular correlation component "
"of the complex given in the output."
msgstr ""
"中心组对应于为 *epart=3* "
"确定的各个单体。在本示例中，发现了两个水单体。相关能被划分为如上所示的四个分量。交换色散、色散和离子分量直接反映了复合物的相关分子间分量，而相互作用能的分子内相关贡献必须通过超分子计算来确定，即从输出中给出的复合物的分子内相关分量中减去（两个）相应的单体相关能。"

msgid "Alternatively, the following form can be used:"
msgstr "或者，可以使用以下形式："

msgid ""
"and the program will then print the energy contributions of all pairs in the"
" ranges between the given distances (in bohr, enclosed by square brackets, "
"e.g., ``enepart,rmax=[0,3,5,7,9,11]``). A second list in which the "
"contributions are given as a function of the number of bonds between the "
"pair domains will also be printed."
msgstr ""
"然后程序将打印所有对在给定距离范围内（以玻尔为单位，用方括号括起来，例如 ``enepart,rmax=[0,3,5,7,9,11]``\\ "
"）的能量贡献。还将打印第二个列表，其中贡献是作为对域之间键数的函数给出的。"

msgid "Split Coulomb operator treatment"
msgstr "分裂 Coulomb 算符处理"

msgid "Doing it right"
msgstr "正确操作"

msgid ""
"The local correlation methods in Molpro employ localized molecular orbitals "
"(LMOs). Pipek-Mezey localization is recommended, but Boys localization is "
"also possible. The virtual orbital space is spanned by non-orthogonal "
"projected atomic orbitals (PAOs). The local character of this basis makes it"
" possible to introduce two distinct approximations: first, excitations are "
"restricted to *domains*, which are subspaces of (PAOs) that are spatially "
"close to the orbitals from which the electrons are being excited. Secondly, "
"the orbital pairs are classified according to their importance (based on "
"distance or connectivity criteria), and only *strong pairs* are treated at "
"the highest level (e.g. CCSD). The remaining *weak* and *distant* pairs are "
"treated at the LMP2 level, and *very distant* pairs are neglected. These "
"approximations lead to linear scaling of the computational resources as a "
"function of the molecular size."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中的局域相关方法使用局域分子轨道（LMOs）。推荐使用 Pipek-Mezey 定域化，但 Boys "
"定域化也可行。虚轨道空间由非正交的投影原子轨道（PAOs）张成。该基组的局域特性使得引入两种不同的近似成为可能：首先，激发被限制在\\ *域*\\ "
"内，这些域是（PAOs）的子空间，在空间上靠近电子被激发出来的轨道。其次，轨道对根据其重要性（基于距离或连通性标准）进行分类，只有\\ *强对*\\ "
"在最高级别（例如 CCSD）处理。剩余的\\ *弱*\\ 对和\\ *远*\\ 对在 LMP2 级别处理，而\\ *非常远*\\ "
"对则被忽略。这些近似使得计算资源随分子尺寸呈线性标度。"

msgid ""
"Naturally, such approximation can introduce some errors, and therefore the "
"user has to be more careful than with standard black box methods. On the "
"other hand, the low-order scaling makes it possible to treat much larger "
"systems at high levels of theory than it was possible so far."
msgstr ""
"自然地，这种近似可能会引入一些误差，因此用户必须比使用标准的黑盒方法更加小心。另一方面，低阶标度使得在比以往更高的理论水平上处理更大的系统成为可能。"

msgid ""
"This section summarizes some important points to remember when performing "
"local correlation calculations."
msgstr "本节总结了执行局域相关计算时需要记住的一些要点。"

msgid "Basis sets"
msgstr "基组"

msgid ""
"For numerical reasons, it is useful to eliminate projected core orbitals, "
"since these may have a very small norm. By default, projected core orbitals "
"are eliminated if their norm is smaller than 0.1 (this behaviour can be "
"changed using the ``DELCOR`` and ``THRCOR`` options). For local calculations"
" we recommend the use of generally contracted basis sets, e.g., the "
"correlation consistent cc-pVnZ sets of Dunning and coworkers. For these "
"basis sets the core basis functions are uniquely defined, and will always be"
" eliminated if the defaults for ``DELCOR`` and ``THRCOR`` are used."
msgstr ""
"出于数值原因，消除投影芯轨道是有用的，因为它们的模可能非常小。默认情况下，如果投影芯轨道的模小于 0.1，则会被消除（此行为可以使用 "
"``DELCOR`` 和 ``THRCOR`` 选项更改）。对于局域计算，我们推荐使用广义收缩基组，例如 Dunning 及其同事的相关一致 cc-"
"pVnZ 基组。对于这些基组，芯基函数是唯一定义的，并且如果使用 ``DELCOR`` 和 ``THRCOR`` 的默认值，它们将始终被消除。"

msgid ""
"The correlation consistent basis sets are also recommended for all density "
"fitting calculations, since optimized fitting basis sets are available for "
"each basis."
msgstr "相关一致基组也推荐用于所有密度拟合计算，因为每个基组都有优化的拟合基组可用。"

msgid "Symmetry and Orientation"
msgstr "对称性与取向"

msgid ""
"**1. Turn off symmetry!** Otherwise, you won’t get appropriately localized "
"orbitals (local orbitals will tend to be symmetry equivalent instead of "
"symmetry adapted). Symmetry can be used only if all atoms are symmetry "
"unique. This allows the local treatment of planar molecules in :math:`C_s` "
"symmetry. But note that neither the multipole program nor the density "
"fitting programs support symmetry at all, so choose always :math:`C_1` "
"symmetry for DF-calculations or with the ``MULTP`` option."
msgstr ""
"**1. 关闭对称性！** "
"否则，你将无法获得适当定域的轨道（局域轨道往往会成为对称等价的，而不是对称适应的）。仅当所有原子在对称性上都是唯一的时，才能使用对称性。这允许在 "
":math:`C_s` 对称性下对平面分子进行局域处理。但请注意，无论是多极矩程序还是密度拟合程序，都完全不支持对称性，因此对于密度拟合计算或使用 "
"``MULTP`` 选项时，请始终选择 :math:`C_1` 对称性。"

msgid ""
"To turn off symmetry, add ``NOSYM`` or ``SYMMETRY,NOSYM`` *before* the "
"geometry block, e.g."
msgstr "要关闭对称性，请在几何结构块\\ *之前*\\ 添加 ``NOSYM`` 或 ``SYMMETRY,NOSYM``\\ ，例如："

msgid ""
"**2. Use NOORIENT!** We recommend to use the ``NOORIENT`` option in the "
"geometry input, to avoid unintended rotations of the molecule when the "
"geometry changes. This is particularly important for geometry optimizations "
"and for domain restarts in calculations of interaction energies (see section"
" `intermolecular interactions <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**2. 使用 NOORIENT！** 我们建议在几何结构输入中使用 ``NOORIENT`` "
"选项，以避免分子在几何结构变化时发生意外的旋转。这对于几何优化以及相互作用能计算中的域重启（参见 `分子间相互作用 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__ "
"一节）尤为重要。"

msgid "Localization"
msgstr "定域化"

msgid ""
"By default, Pipek-Mezey localization is used and performed automatically in "
"the beginning of a local correlation calculation. Thus"
msgstr "默认情况下，使用 Pipek-Mezey 定域化，并在局域相关计算开始时自动执行。因此"

msgid ""
"Boys localization can be used as well, but in this case the localization "
"must be done beforehand, e.g."
msgstr "也可以使用 Boys 定域化，但在这种情况下，必须事先完成定域化，例如："

msgid ""
"Poor localization is sometimes an intrinsic problem, in particular for "
"strongly conjugated systems or when diffuse basis sets are used. This is "
"caused by localization tails due to the overlapping diffuse functions. The "
"problem is particularly frequent in calculations of systems with short "
"bonds, e.g., aromatic molecules. It can be avoided using directive"
msgstr ""
"定域化效果不佳有时是一个固有问题，特别是对于强共轭体系或使用弥散基组时。这是由于重叠的弥散函数导致的定域化拖尾造成的。这个问题在计算具有短键的体系（例如芳香族分子）时尤为常见。可以通过使用指令来避免"

msgid ""
"with :math:`n=1` or :math:`2`. This means that the contributions of the "
":math:`n` most diffuse basis functions of each angular momentum type are "
"ignored in the localization. This often yields much better localized "
"orbitals when diffuse basis sets are used. For aug-cc-pVTZ, :math:`n=2` has "
"been found to work very well, while for aug-cc-pVDZ :math:`n`\\ =1"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`n=1` 或 :math:`2`\\ 。这意味着在定域化过程中，每种角动量类型的 :math:`n` "
"个最弥散的基函数的贡献将被忽略。当使用弥散基组时，这通常能产生更好的定域轨道。对于 aug-cc-pVTZ，已发现 :math:`n=2` "
"效果很好，而对于 aug-cc-pVDZ，\\ :math:`n`\\ =1"

msgid ""
"In rare cases it might also happen that the localization procedure does not "
"converge. It is them possible to choose a second-order Newton-Raphson "
"localization scheme, using the directive"
msgstr "在极少数情况下，定域化过程也可能不收敛。此时可以选择使用二阶牛顿-拉夫森定域化方案，通过指令"

msgid ""
"This happens for example in LMP2 optimizations of benzene or other highly "
"symmetric aromatics, where the Pipek-Mezey localization has redundant "
"orbital rotations. Instead of ``PIPEK,METHOD=2`` one can also use option "
"``CPLSOLVE=2``."
msgstr ""
"例如，在苯或其他高度对称芳香族化合物的 LMP2 优化中会发生这种情况，其中 Pipek-Mezey 定域化存在冗余的轨道旋转。除了 "
"``PIPEK,METHOD=2``\\ ，也可以使用选项 ``CPLSOLVE=2``\\ 。"

msgid "Normally (default) one can use"
msgstr "通常（默认）可以使用"

msgid ""
"which performs standard Pipek-Mezey iterations, which usually converge "
"quickly."
msgstr "它执行标准的 Pipek-Mezey 迭代，通常收敛很快。"

msgid "Orbital domains"
msgstr "轨道域"

msgid ""
"The orbital domains are determined automatically using the procedure of "
"Boughton and Pulay, `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/jcc.540140615>`__ **14**, 736 (1993) and `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.471289>`__ **104**, 6286 (1996). "
"For higher accuracy the domains can be extended, and in this way the "
"canonical result can be systematically approached (cf. Ref. [1] and section "
"`extended domains <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#extended-"
"domains>`__). Details are described in section `options for selection of "
"domains <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-"
"of-domains>`__."
msgstr ""
"轨道域是使用 Boughton 和 Pulay 的程序自动确定的，参见 `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/jcc.540140615>`__ **14**, 736 (1993) 和 `J. Chem."
" Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.471289>`__ **104**, 6286 "
"(1996)。为了获得更高的精度，可以扩展这些域，通过这种方式可以系统地逼近正则结果（参见参考文献 [1] 和章节 `扩展域 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#extended-domains>`__\\ ）。详细信息在章节 "
"`域选择选项 <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-"
"of-domains>`__ 中描述。"

msgid ""
"In most cases, the domain selection is uncritical for saturated molecules. "
"Nevertheless, in particular for delocalized systems, it is recommended "
"always to check the orbital domains, which are printed in the beginning of "
"each local calculation. For such checking, the option ``DOMONLY=1`` can be "
"used to stop the calculation after the domain generation. The orbital "
"domains consist of all basis functions for a subset of atoms. These atoms "
"are selected so that the domain spans the corresponding localized orbital "
"with a preset accuracy (alterable with option ``THRBP``). A typical domain "
"output, here for water, looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，对于饱和分子，域选择并不关键。然而，特别是对于离域体系，建议始终检查轨道域，这些域会在每次局域计算开始时打印出来。为了进行此类检查，可以使用选项"
" ``DOMONLY=1`` 在域生成后停止计算。轨道域由原子子集的所有基函数组成。选择这些原子是为了使域以预设的精度（可通过选项 ``THRBP`` "
"更改）张成相应的定域轨道。一个典型的域输出，这里以水分子为例，看起来像这样："

msgid ""
"This tells you that the domains for orbitals 2.1 and 5.1 comprise the basis "
"functions of the oxygen atom and and one hydrogen atom, while the domains "
"for orbitals 3.1 and 4.1 consist of the basis function on oxygen only. The "
"latter ones correspond to the oxygen lone pairs, the former to the two OH "
"bonds, and so this is exactly what one would expect. For each domain of AOs,"
" corresponding projected atomic orbitals (PAOs) are generated, which span "
"subspaces of the virtual space and into which excitations are made. Options "
"which affect the domain selection are described in section `options for "
"selection of domains <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-"
"for-selection-of-domains>`__. Improper domains can result from poorly "
"localized orbitals (see section `localization <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#localization>`__ or a forgotten "
"``NOSYM`` directive. This does not only negatively affect performance and "
"memory requirements, but can also lead to unexpected results."
msgstr ""
"这告诉你，轨道 2.1 和 5.1 的域包含氧原子和一个氢原子的基函数，而轨道 3.1 和 4.1 "
"的域仅由氧原子上的基函数组成。后者对应于氧的孤对电子，前者对应于两个 OH "
"键，因此这正是人们所期望的。对于每个原子轨道域，会生成相应的投影原子轨道，它们张成虚空间的子空间，激发作用在这些子空间中进行。影响域选择的选项在章节 "
"`域选择选项 <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-"
"of-domains>`__ 中描述。不恰当的域可能源于定域化不良的轨道（参见章节 `定域化 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#localization>`__\\ ）或遗漏的 ``NOSYM`` "
"指令。这不仅会对性能和内存需求产生负面影响，还可能导致意想不到的结果。"

msgid ""
"The default for the selection criterion ``THRBP`` is 0.98. This works "
"usually well for small basis sets like cc-pVDZ. For larger basis sets like "
"cc-pVTZ we recommend to use a slightly larger value of 0.985 to ensure that "
"enough atoms are included in each domain. For cc-pVQZ recommend "
"``THRBP=0.990`` is recommended. In cases of doubt, compare the domains you "
"get with a smaller basis (e.g., cc-pVDZ)."
msgstr ""
"选择标准 ``THRBP`` 的默认值为 0.98。这对于像 cc-pVDZ 这样的小基组通常效果良好。对于像 cc-pVTZ "
"这样较大的基组，我们建议使用稍大的值 0.985，以确保每个域中包含足够的原子。对于 cc-pVQZ，建议使用 ``THRBP=0.990``\\ "
"。如有疑问，请将你得到的域与较小基组（例如 cc-pVDZ）的结果进行比较。"

msgid ""
"The choice of domains usually has only a weak effect on near-equilibrium "
"properties like equilibrium geometries and harmonic vibrational frequencies."
" More critical are energy differences like reaction energies or barrier "
"heights. In cases where the electronic structure strongly changes, e.g., "
"when the number of double bonds changes, it is recommended to compare DF-"
"LMP2 and DF-MP2 results before performing expensive LCCSD(T) calculations. "
"More balanced results and smooth potentials can be obtained using the "
"``MERGEDOM`` directive, see section `domain Merging (MERGEDOM) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#domain-merging-mergedom>`__."
msgstr ""
"域的选择通常对近平衡性质（如平衡几何结构和谐波振动频率）影响较弱。更关键的是能量差，如反应能或势垒高度。在电子结构发生强烈变化的情况下（例如，当双键数量发生变化时），建议在进行昂贵的"
" LCCSD(T) 计算之前，先比较 DF-LMP2 和 DF-MP2 的结果。使用 ``MERGEDOM`` "
"指令可以获得更平衡的结果和平滑的势能面，参见章节 `域合并 (MERGEDOM) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#domain-merging-mergedom>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Freezing domains"
msgstr "冻结域"

msgid ""
"In order to obtain smooth potential energy surfaces, domains must be frozen."
" The domain information can be stored using the ``SAVE`` option and "
"recovered using the ``START`` option. Alternatively, the ``SAVE`` and "
"``START`` can be used, see section `saving the wavefunction (SAVE) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#saving-the-wavefunction-save>`__. In"
" the latter case, also the CCSD amplitudes are saved/restarted. Freezing "
"domains is particularly important in calculations of intermolecular "
"interactions, see section `intermolecular interactions <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__. "
"Domains that are appropriate for larger ranges of geometries, such as "
"reaction pathways, can be generated using the ``MERGEDOM`` directive, "
"section `domain Merging (MERGEDOM) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#domain-merging-mergedom>`__. The "
"domains are automatically frozen in geometry optimizations and frequency "
"calculations, see section `gradients and frequency calculations <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#gradients-and-frequency-"
"calculations>`__. Note, however, that this automatic procedure only works if"
" a single local calculation is involved in the optimization. In case of "
"optimizations with counterpoise correction the domains for the complex and "
"each monomer must be frozen individually in different records using the "
"``SAVE`` and ``START`` directives."
msgstr ""
"为了获得平滑的势能面，必须冻结域。域信息可以使用 ``SAVE`` 选项存储，并使用 ``START`` 选项恢复。或者，也可以使用 ``SAVE`` "
"和 ``START``\\ ，参见章节 `保存波函数 (SAVE) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#saving-the-wavefunction-save>`__\\ "
"。在后一种情况下，CCSD 振幅也会被保存/重启。冻结域在计算分子间相互作用时尤为重要，参见章节 `分子间相互作用 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__\\ "
"。适用于更大几何范围（如反应路径）的域可以使用 ``MERGEDOM`` 指令生成，参见章节 `域合并 (MERGEDOM) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#domain-merging-mergedom>`__\\ "
"。在几何优化和频率计算中，域会自动冻结，参见章节 `梯度和频率计算 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#gradients-and-frequency-"
"calculations>`__\\ "
"。但请注意，此自动过程仅在优化中涉及单个局域计算时才有效。在使用均衡校正进行优化的情况下，复合物和每个单体的域必须使用 ``SAVE`` 和 "
"``START`` 指令在不同的记录中单独冻结。"

msgid "Pair Classes"
msgstr "对儿类别"

msgid ""
"The *strong*, *close*, *weak* and *distant* pairs are selected using "
"distance or connectivity criteria as described in more detail in section "
"`options for selection of pair classes <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-of-pair-"
"classes>`__. *Strong* pairs are treated by CCSD, all other pairs by LMP2. In"
" triples calculations, all orbital triples :math:`(ijk)` are included for "
"which :math:`(ij)`, :math:`(ik)`, and :math:`(jk)` are *close pairs*. In "
"addition, one of these pairs is restricted to be strong. The triples energy "
"depends on the strong and close pair amplitudes. The close pair amplitudes "
"are taken from the LMP2 calculation. Thus, increasing the distance or "
"connectivity criteria for close and weak pairs will lead to more accurate "
"triples energies. While for near equilibrium properties like geometries and "
"harmonic vibrational frequencies the default values are normally "
"appropriate, larger distance criteria are sometimes needed when computing "
"energy differences, in particular barrier heights. In cases of doubt, "
"``RWEAK`` should first be increased until convergence is reached, and then "
"``RCLOSE`` can be varied as well. Such tests can be performed with small "
"basis sets like cc-pVDZ, and the optimized values then be used in the final "
"calculations with large basis sets."
msgstr ""
"*强*\\ 、\\ *近*\\ 、\\ *弱*\\ 和\\ *远*\\ 对儿根据距离或连接性标准进行选择，详见章节 `options for "
"selection of pair classes <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-of-pair-"
"classes>`__\\ 。\\ *强*\\ 对儿由 CCSD 处理，所有其他对儿由 LMP2 处理。在三重激发能计算中，包含所有满足 "
":math:`(ij)`\\ 、\\ :math:`(ik)` 和 :math:`(jk)` 均为\\ *近对*\\ 的轨道三重激发 "
":math:`(ijk)`\\ 。此外，这些对儿中有一个被限制为强对。三重激发能依赖于强对和近对的振幅。近对振幅取自 LMP2 "
"计算。因此，增加近对和弱对的距离或连接性标准将得到更精确的三重激发能。虽然对于接近平衡的性质（如几何结构和简谐振动频率），默认值通常是合适的，但在计算能量差（特别是势垒高度）时，有时需要更大的距离标准。如有疑问，应首先增加"
" ``RWEAK`` 直到达到收敛，然后也可以调整 ``RCLOSE``\\ 。此类测试可以使用小基组（如 cc-"
"pVDZ）进行，然后将优化后的值用于最终的大基组计算。"

msgid "Gradients and frequency calculations"
msgstr "梯度和频率计算"

msgid ""
"In geometry optimizations, the domains are allowed to vary in the initial "
"optimization steps. When the stepsize drops below a certain threshold "
"(default 0.01) the domains are automatically frozen. In numerical Hessian or"
" frequency calculations the domains are also frozen. It is therefore not "
"necessary to include ``SAVE`` and ``START`` options."
msgstr ""
"在几何优化中，允许域在初始优化步长中变化。当步长低于某个阈值（默认 0.01）时，域会自动冻结。在数值 Hessian "
"矩阵或频率计算中，域也会被冻结。因此，没有必要包含 ``SAVE`` 和 ``START`` 选项。"

msgid ""
"Particular care must be taken in optimizations of highly symmetric aromatic "
"systems, like, e.g., benzene. In :math:`D_{6h}` symmetry, the localization "
"of the :math:`\\pi`-orbitals is not unique, i.e., the localized orbitals can"
" be rotated around the :math:`C_6` axis without changing the localization "
"criterion. This redundancy is lost if the symmetry is slightly distorted, "
"which can lead to sudden changes of the localized orbitals. If now the "
"domains are kept fixed using the ``SAVE`` and ``START`` options, a large "
"error in the energy might result. On the other hand, if the domains are not "
"kept fixed, their size and quality might change during the optimization, "
"again leading to spurious energy changes and divergence of the optimization."
msgstr ""
"在优化高度对称的芳香体系（例如苯）时必须特别小心。在 :math:`D_{6h}` 对称性下，\\ :math:`\\pi` "
"轨道的定域化不是唯一的，即定域轨道可以围绕 :math:`C_6` "
"轴旋转而不改变定域化标准。如果对称性稍有畸变，这种冗余性就会丧失，这可能导致定域轨道的突然变化。如果现在使用 ``SAVE`` 和 ``START`` "
"选项保持域固定，可能会导致能量出现较大误差。另一方面，如果域不保持固定，它们的大小和质量可能在优化过程中发生变化，再次导致虚假的能量变化和优化发散。"

msgid ""
"The best way to avoid this problem is to use the ``MERGEDOM=1`` option (see "
"section `options for selection of domains <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-of-"
"domains>`__). If this option is given, the domains for the :math:`\\pi` "
"orbitals will comprise the basis functions of all six carbon atoms, and the "
"energy will be invariant with respect to unitary transformations among the "
"three :math:`\\pi` orbitals. Note that this problem does not occur if the "
"symmetry of the aromatic system is lowered by a substituent."
msgstr ""
"避免此问题的最佳方法是使用 ``MERGEDOM=1`` 选项（参见章节 `options for selection of domains <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#options-for-selection-of-"
"domains>`__\\ ）。如果给出此选项，\\ :math:`\\pi` 轨道的域将包含所有六个碳原子的基函数，并且能量对于三个 "
":math:`\\pi` 轨道之间的酉变换将保持不变。请注意，如果芳香体系的对称性被取代基降低，则不会出现此问题。"

msgid ""
"Redundant orbital rotations can also lead to convergence difficulties of the"
" ``Pipek-Mezey`` localization. This can be overcome by using"
msgstr "冗余的轨道旋转也可能导致 ``Pipek-Mezey`` 定域化的收敛困难。这可以通过使用"

msgid "``PIPEK,METHOD=2``"
msgstr "``PIPEK,METHOD=2``"

msgid ""
"With ``METHOD=2``, the second derivatives of the localization criterion with"
" respect to the orbital rotations is computed and diagonalized, and "
"rotations corresponding to zero eigenvalues are eliminated. This method "
"converges quadratically and should be used when highly symmetric aromatic "
"systems are optimized. With ``METHOD=3`` (default) standard Pipek-Mezey "
"method are performed."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``METHOD=2`` "
"时，会计算并对角化定域化准则相对于轨道旋转的二阶导数，并消除对应于零特征值的旋转。该方法具有二次收敛性，应在优化高度对称的芳香体系时使用。使用 "
"``METHOD=3``\\ （默认）时，则执行标准的 Pipek-Mezey 方法。"

msgid ""
"Finally, we note that the LMP2 gradients are quite sensitive to the accuracy"
" of the SCF convergence (as is also the case for MP2). If very accurate "
"structures are required, or if numerical frequencies are computed from the "
"gradients, the default SCF accuracy might be insufficient. We recommend in "
"such cases to add an ``ACCU,14`` directive (possibly even ``ACCU,16``) after"
" the ``HF`` command. Indicative of insufficient SCF accuracy are small "
"positive energy changes near the end of the geometry optimization."
msgstr ""
"最后，我们注意到 LMP2 梯度对 SCF 收敛的精度相当敏感（MP2 也是如此）。如果需要非常精确的结构，或者要从梯度计算数值频率，默认的 SCF "
"精度可能不足。在这种情况下，我们建议在 ``HF`` 命令后添加一个 ``ACCU,14`` 指令（甚至可能是 ``ACCU,16``\\ ）。SCF "
"精度不足的迹象是在几何优化接近结束时出现微小的正能量变化。"

msgid "Intermolecular interactions"
msgstr "分子间相互作用"

msgid ""
"Local methods are particularly useful for the calculation of weak "
"intermolecular interactions since the basis set superposition error (BSSE) "
"is largely reduced [1,13,14] and counterpoise corrections are usually not "
"necessary (provided the BSSE of the underlying Hartree-Fock is small). "
"However, one must be careful to define the domains properly and to include "
"all intermolecular pairs at the highest computational level. A convenient "
"way to define appropriate domains and pair lists is to use the option "
"``INTERACT=1``. If this option is given, individual molecules are identified"
" automatically and all intermolecular pairs are automatically treated as "
"strong pairs and included in the LCCSD. Similarly, appropriate triples lists"
" are generated for LCCSD(T) calculations. It is required that all orbital "
"domains are located on individual molecules. Note however that the inclusion"
" of the intermolecular pairs strongly increases the number of strong pairs "
"and triples, and therefore high-level calculations can become very "
"expensive."
msgstr ""
"局域方法对于计算弱分子间相互作用特别有用，因为基组重叠误差（BSSE）被大大降低 [1,13,14]，并且通常不需要均衡校正（前提是底层 "
"Hartree-Fock 的 BSSE 很小）。然而，必须小心正确定义域，并在最高计算级别包含所有分子间对。定义适当域和对列表的一种便捷方法是使用选项 "
"``INTERACT=1``\\ 。如果给出此选项，单个分子将被自动识别，并且所有分子间对将自动被视为强对并包含在 LCCSD 中。类似地，会为 "
"LCCSD(T) "
"计算生成适当的三重组列表。要求所有轨道域都位于单个分子上。但请注意，包含分子间对会显著增加强对和三重组的数量，因此高级别计算可能变得非常昂贵。"

msgid ""
"For calculations of interaction potentials of weakly interacting systems, "
"the domains of the subsystems should be determined at a very large distance "
"and saved using the ``SAVE=``\\ *record* option on the ``LOCAL`` or "
"``MULTP`` directive, or the ``SAVE`` directive (see section `saving the "
"wavefunction (SAVE) <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#saving-the-"
"wavefunction-save>`__). If the asymptotic energy is not needed it is "
"sufficient to do this initial calculation using option ``DOMONLY=1``). These"
" domains should then be reused in the subsequent calculations at all other "
"intermolecular distances by using the ``START``\\ =\\ *record* option or the"
" ``START`` directive (see section `restarting a calculation (START) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#restarting-a-calculation-start>`__)."
" Only in this way the basis set superposition error is minimized and "
"normally negligible (of course, this does not affect the BSSE for the SCF, "
"and therefore the basis set should be sufficiently large to make the SCF "
"BSSE negligible)."
msgstr ""
"对于弱相互作用体系的相互作用势计算，应在非常大的距离处确定子系统的域，并使用 ``LOCAL`` 或 ``MULTP`` 指令上的 "
"``SAVE=``\\ *记录* 选项或 ``SAVE`` 指令保存（参见 `保存波函数 (SAVE) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#saving-the-wavefunction-save>`__ "
"一节）。如果不需要渐近能量，则使用选项 ``DOMONLY=1`` 进行此初始计算即可）。然后应通过使用 ``START``\\ =\\ *记录* "
"选项或 ``START`` 指令（参见 `重启计算 (START) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#restarting-a-calculation-start>`__ "
"一节），在所有其他分子间距离的后续计算中重用这些域。只有这样，基组重叠误差才能被最小化并通常可以忽略不计（当然，这不会影响 SCF 的 "
"BSSE，因此基组应足够大以使 SCF BSSE 可忽略）。"

msgid ""
"Usually, diffuse basis functions are important for obtaining accurate "
"intermolecular interactions. When diffuse basis sets are used, it may happen"
" that the Pipek-Mezey localization does not yield well localized orbitals. "
"This problem can in most cases be overcome by using the directive"
msgstr ""
"通常，弥散基函数对于获得精确的分子间相互作用很重要。当使用弥散基组时，可能会出现 Pipek-Mezey "
"定域化无法产生良好定域轨道的情况。在大多数情况下，可以通过使用指令"

msgid ""
"as described in section `localization <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#localization>`__"
msgstr ""
"如 `定域化 <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#localization>`__ 一节所述"

msgid "For examples and discussions of these aspects see Refs. [21-23]"
msgstr "关于这些方面的示例和讨论，请参阅参考文献 [21-23]。"

msgid "Efficient and accurate treatment of close pairs in local CCSD(T)"
msgstr "局域 CCSD(T) 中近对的高效精确处理"

msgid ""
"These methods for close pairs are discussed in detail in Refs. [24-25]. The "
"philosophy is to include all diagrams with R\\ :math:`^{-6}` decay behavior "
"up to a certain order of perturbation theory. *E.g.*, LringCCD3 denotes "
"local ring CCD up to third-order diagrams, and LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}` is "
"full local CCD with a perturbative singles correction, yet omitting all "
"diagrams with decay behavior quicker than R\\ :math:`^{-6}` (like ladder "
"diagrams). As shown in Ref. [25], the LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}` provides "
"excellent intermolecular interaction energies, virtually indistinguishable "
"from LCCSD, at a much lower cost (mainly due to the omission of ladders). We"
" therefore recommend to use either LringCCD3 or LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}`. "
"Note that it is essential to couple strong and close pairs in such "
"calculations, *i.e.*, to set ``keepcls=1`` (*vide supra*). As an example, "
"the input segment to set all intermolecular pairs to close and treat them at"
" the level of LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}` is"
msgstr ""
"这些针对近对的方法在文献 [24-25] 中有详细讨论。其理念是包含所有具有 R\\ :math:`^{-6}` "
"衰减行为的图，直至微扰理论的某一特定阶数。\\ *例如*\\ ，LringCCD3 表示包含至三阶图的局域环 CCD，而 LCCD[S]-R\\ "
":math:`^{-6}` 则是带有微扰单激发修正的完整局域 CCD，但省略了所有衰减行为快于 R\\ :math:`^{-6}` "
"的图（如梯形图）。如文献 [25] 所示，LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}` "
"能以低得多的成本（主要由于省略了梯形图）提供优异的分子间相互作用能，其结果与 LCCSD 几乎无法区分。因此，我们建议使用 LringCCD3 或 "
"LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}`\\ 。请注意，在此类计算中耦合强对和近对至关重要，\\ *即*\\ ，设置 "
"``keepcls=1``\\ （\\ *见上文*\\ ）。例如，将全部分子间对设置为近对并在 LCCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}` "
"级别处理的输入片段为"

msgid ""
"Density-fitted LMP2 (DF-LMP2), LDCSD (DF-LDCSD), and coupled cluster (DF-"
"LCCSD(T0))"
msgstr "密度拟合 LMP2 (DF-LMP2)、LDCSD (DF-LDCSD) 和耦合簇 (DF-LCCSD(T0))"

msgid "[sec:locdf]"
msgstr "[sec:locdf]"

msgid ""
"Density-fitting LMP2, LDCSD and LCCSD calculations can be performed by "
"adding the prefix ``DF-`` to the command name. The input is as follows:"
msgstr "密度拟合 LMP2、LDCSD 和 LCCSD 计算可以通过在命令名称前添加前缀 ``DF-`` 来执行。输入如下："

msgid "The most important options for density fitting in local methods are"
msgstr "局域方法中密度拟合最重要的选项是"

msgid ""
"In this section the original PAO-based local correlation methods are "
"described. Since Molpro version 2018, a completely new PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 "
"program is available, which is much more accurate and well parallelized. It "
"is recommended to use this new program, which is described in section "
":doc:`local correlation methods with pair natural orbitals (PNOs) "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`."
msgstr ""
"本节描述原始的基于 PAO 的局域相关方法。自 Molpro 2018 版本起，提供了全新的 PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 "
"程序，其精度更高且并行化良好。建议使用这一新程序，详见 :doc:`使用对自然轨道（PNO）的局域相关方法 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` 一节。"

msgid ""
"Local explicitly correlated methods (DF-LMP2-R12 and DF-LMP2-F12, DF-"
"LCCSD(T)-F12 are described in section :doc:`explicitly correlated methods "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"局域显式相关方法（DF-LMP2-R12 与 DF-LMP2-F12，DF-LCCSD(T)-F12）在 :doc:`显式相关方法 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods>` 一节中描述。"

msgid ""
"**Review**: :math:`[1]` H.-J. Werner and K. Pflüger, *On the selection of "
"domains and orbital pairs in local correlation treatments*, `Ann. Rep. Comp."
" Chem. <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1574-1400(06)02004-4>`__ **2**, 53 (2006)."
msgstr ""
"**综述**\\ ：\\ :math:`[1]` H.-J. Werner and K. Pflüger, *On the selection of "
"domains and orbital pairs in local correlation treatments*, `Ann. Rep. Comp."
" Chem. <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1574-1400(06)02004-4>`__ **2**, 53 (2006)."

msgid ""
