msgid "**``LOCAL``\\ =\\ *local*** Determines which method is used:"
msgstr "**``LOCAL``\\ =\\ *\\ local*** 确定所使用的方法："

msgid ""
"``LOCAL=0: Conventional (non-local) calculation.\\\\`` ``LOCAL=1``: Local "
"method is simulated using canonical MOs. The local basis is used only at an "
"intermediate stage to update the amplitudes in each iteration (only for "
"testing). ``LOCAL=2``: Calculation is done in local basis, but without using"
" local blocking (i.e. full matrices are used). This is the most expensive "
"method and only for testing. ``LOCAL=3: Fully local calculation "
"(obsolete).\\\\`` ``LOCAL=4``: Fully local calculation (default). This is "
"the fastest method for large molecules with many weak pairs and requires "
"minimum memory."
msgstr ""
"``LOCAL=0: Conventional (non-local) calculation.\\\\`` ``LOCAL=1``: Local "
"method is simulated using canonical MOs. The local basis is used only at an "
"intermediate stage to update the amplitudes in each iteration (only for "
"testing). ``LOCAL=2``: Calculation is done in local basis, but without using"
" local blocking (i.e. full matrices are used). This is the most expensive "
"method and only for testing. ``LOCAL=3: Fully local calculation "
"(obsolete).\\\\`` ``LOCAL=4``: Fully local calculation (default). This is "
"the fastest method for large molecules with many weak pairs and requires "
"minimum memory."

msgid ""
"**``LOCORB``\\ =\\ *option*** If this option is given and *option*\\ "
":math:`\\gt 0`, the orbitals are localized using the Pipek-Mezey technique. "
"If this option is not given or *option*\\ =0 (default), the orbitals are "
"localized unless localized orbitals are found in the orbital record (cf. "
"``ORBITAL`` directive and ``LOCALI`` command). In the latter case, the most "
"recent localized orbitals are used. Setting *option*\\ =-1 switches the "
"localization off. If *option*\\ :math:`\\gt 1` the localized orbitals are "
"printed. Note: Boys localization can only be performed using the ``LOCALI`` "
"command. The program will use the Boys orbitals if they are found in the "
"orbital record and the ``LOCORB`` option is absent or *option*\\ :math:`\\le"
" 0`."
msgstr ""
"**``LOCORB``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 若给出此选项且 *\\ option\\ *\\ :math:`\\gt 0`，则使用"
" Pipek-Mezey 方法对轨道进行定域化。若未给出此选项或 *\\ option\\ *\\ "
"=0（默认），则对轨道进行定域化，除非在轨道记录中找到了定域轨道（参见 ``ORBITAL`` 指令和 ``LOCALI`` "
"命令）。在后一种情况下，将使用最近的定域轨道。设置 *\\ option\\ *\\ =-1 会关闭定域化。若 *\\ option\\ *\\ "
":math:`\\gt 1`，则打印定域轨道。注意：Boys 定域化只能通过 ``LOCALI`` 命令执行。如果轨道记录中存在 Boys 轨道且 "
"``LOCORB`` 选项缺失或 *\\ option*\\ :math:`\\le 0`\\ ，程序将使用 Boys 轨道。"

msgid ""
"**``LOC_METHOD``\\ =\\ *method*** This option allows to select between "
"Pipek-Mezey (*method*\\ =\\ ``PM``) or Natural Orbitals (*method*\\ =\\ "
"``NBO``) localization. If Pipek-Mezey orbitals are requested, the default "
"Boughton-Pulay domain selection will be used. When *method*\\ =\\ ``NBO``, "
"the domain selection will be based on the NPA charges, with ``NPASEL``\\ "
"=0.03 (by default). In both cases, the domain selection parameter can be "
"explicitly given (cf. ``DOMSEL`` and ``NPASEL`` options) in order to use "
"another domain criterion. If localized orbitals are found in the orbital "
"record, but the type does not coincide, the orbitals are again localized "
"according to *method* and used in the calculation."
msgstr ""
"**``LOC_METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ method*** 此选项允许在 Pipek-Mezey（*\\ method\\ *\\ =\\"
" ``PM``）或自然轨道（*\\ method\\ *\\ =\\ ``NBO``）定域化之间进行选择。若请求 Pipek-Mezey "
"轨道，将使用默认的 Boughton-Pulay 域选择。当 *\\ method\\ *\\ =\\ ``NBO`` 时，域选择将基于 NPA "
"电荷，且 ``NPASEL``\\ =0.03（默认）。在两种情况下，都可以显式给出域选择参数（参见 ``DOMSEL`` 和 ``NPASEL`` "
"选项）以使用其他域判断标准。若在轨道记录中找到了定域轨道但类型不一致，则轨道将再次根据 *\\ method* 进行定域化并用于计算。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVORB``\\ =\\ *record*** Allows the localized and projected orbitals to"
" be saved in *record=name.ifil* for later use (e.g. plotting). The two "
"orbital sets are stored in the same dump record and can be restored at later"
" stages using"
msgstr ""
"**``SAVORB``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 允许将定域轨道和投影轨道保存到 *\\ record=name.ifil* "
"以供后续使用（例如绘图）。这两组轨道存储在同一个转储记录中，并可在后续阶段使用以下命令恢复"

msgid ""
"``ORBITAL``,\\ *record*,[``TYPE``\\ =]\\ ``LOCAL`` or "
"``ORBITAL,record,[TYPE=]PROJECTED, respectively.``"
msgstr ""
"``ORBITAL``,\\ *record*,[``TYPE``\\ =]\\ ``LOCAL`` 或 "
"``ORBITAL,record,[TYPE=]PROJECTED, respectively.``"

msgid ""
"**``DOMONLY``\\ =\\ *value*** If *value*\\ :math:`\\gt 0` only domains are "
"made, but no energy is computed. This can be used to check and save the "
"domains for later use."
msgstr ""
"**``DOMONLY``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若 *\\ value*\\ :math:`\\gt 0`\\ "
"，则仅生成域而不计算能量。这可用于检查并保存域以供后续使用。"

msgid ""
"**``DSTMLT``\\ =\\ *level*** Determines the expansion level of the multipole"
" expansion of distant pairs (e.g. 1 means dipole approximation, 2 quadrupole"
" approximation and so on). The default for ``MULTP`` is 3."
msgstr ""
"**``DSTMLT``\\ =\\ *\\ level*** 确定远对多极展开的展开阶数（例如 1 表示偶极近似，2 表示四极近似，依此类推）。\\ "
"``MULTP`` 的默认值为 3。"

msgid "**\\*\\*Parameters for energy partitioning:**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*能量分配参数：**\\*\\*"

msgid "**``IEPART``\\ =\\ *value*** enables/disables energy partitioning."
msgstr "**``IEPART``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 启用/禁用能量分配。"

msgid ""
"*iepart=0*: Energy partitioning is disabled. *iepart=1*: Energy partitioning"
" is enabled. *iepart=2*: Energy partitioning is enabled. Additionally, a "
"list of all pair energies and their components is printed."
msgstr ""
"*iepart=0*\\ ：禁用能量分配。\\ *iepart=1*\\ ：启用能量分配。\\ *iepart=2*\\ "
"：启用能量分配。此外，还会打印所有对能量及其分量的列表。"

msgid ""
"**``EPART``\\ =\\ *cutoff*** Cutoff parameter to determine individual "
"monomers in a cluster (i.e. centre groups). Should be somewhat larger than "
"the largest intramolecular bond length (given in a.u.)."
msgstr ""
"**``EPART``\\ =\\ *\\ cutoff*** 用于确定簇中各个单体（即中心基团）的截断参数。应略大于最大的分子内键长（以 a.u. "
"为单位）。"

msgid "**\\*\\*Miscellaneous options:**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*其他选项：**\\*\\*"

msgid ""
"**``SKIPDIST``\\ =\\ *skipdist*** Test-parameter. Its value should only "
"affect the efficiency but not influence the results."
msgstr "**``SKIPDIST``\\ =\\ *\\ skipdist*** 测试参数。其值只应影响效率，而不应影响结果。"

msgid ""
"*skipdist=-1*: Weak and distant pairs are set to zero after MP2 but are not "
"eliminated from the pair list and not skipped in any loop. *skipdist=0*: No "
"pairs are deleted from pair list, but weak and distant pairs are skipped in "
"the loops were appropriate. *skipdist=1*: Very distant pairs are neglected "
"from the beginning. Distant pairs are eliminated after MP2. *skipdist=2*: As"
" skipdist=1, but also weak pairs are eliminated after MP2. *skipdist=3*: As "
"skipdist=2, but distant pairs are eliminated from the operator list in case "
"of LMP2 with multipole approximations for distant pairs. This is the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"*skipdist=-1*\\ ：弱对和远对在 MP2 之后置零，但不从对列表中消除，也不在任何循环中跳过。\\ *skipdist=0*\\ "
"：不从对列表中删除任何对，但在适当的地方跳过弱对和远对。\\ *skipdist=1*\\ ：从一开始就忽略极远对。远对在 MP2 之后消除。\\ "
"*skipdist=2*\\ ：与 skipdist=1 相同，但弱对也在 MP2 之后消除。\\ *skipdist=3*\\ ：与 "
"skipdist=2 相同，但在使用多极近似处理远对的 LMP2 情况下，远对从算符列表中消除。这是默认值。"

msgid ""
"**``ASYDOM``\\ =\\ *jiterm*** Experimental test parameter. Enables the use "
"of asymmetric domains for distant pairs. The asymmetric domain approximation"
" supplements the multipole approximation for distant pairs, as it suppresses"
" the treatment of configurations for which no integrals can be computed by "
"multipole expansion. This leads to computational savings and improved "
"numerical stability."
msgstr ""
"**``ASYDOM``\\ =\\ *\\ jiterm*** "
"实验性测试参数。启用远对的不对称域。不对称域近似补充了远对的多极近似，因为它抑制了对无法通过多极展开计算积分的组态的处理。这带来了计算量的节省和数值稳定性的提高。"

msgid ""
"*jiterm=0*: Disable asymmetric domains. *jiterm=-1*: Enable asymmetric "
"domains (default). *jiterm=-2*: Enable a variation of the asymmetric domain "
"formalism: Exchange operators will initially be projected to the asymmetric "
"domain instead of simply packed."
msgstr ""
"*jiterm=0*\\ ：禁用不对称域。\\ *jiterm=-1*\\ ：启用不对称域（默认）。\\ *jiterm=-2*\\ "
"：启用不对称域形式的一种变体：交换算符最初被投影到不对称域，而不是简单地打包。"

msgid ""
"**``LOCSING``\\ =\\ *locsing*** If *locsing.ne.0*, the single excitations "
"use the full space, i.e., they are not treated locally. This is only works "
"for ``LOCAL=1``."
msgstr ""
"**``LOCSING``\\ =\\ *\\ locsing*** 如果 *\\ "
"locsing.ne.0*，单激发使用完全空间，即不进行局域处理。这仅适用于 ``LOCAL=1``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXANG``\\ =\\ *lmax*** The purpose of this experimental option is to "
"reduce the basis set sensitivity of the Boughton-Pulay (BP) method for "
"domain selection. Only basis functions with angular momentum up to *lmax-1* "
"are included when computing the overlap of the approximate and exact "
"orbitals. For example, ``MAXANG=2`` means to omit all contributions of "
":math:`d`, :math:`f` and higher angular momentum functions. To obtain "
"reasonable domains, the value of ``THRBP`` must often be reduced (to 0.97 or"
" so). This option should only be used with care!"
msgstr ""
"**``MAXANG``\\ =\\ *\\ lmax*** 此实验性选项的目的是降低 Boughton-"
"Pulay（BP）域选择方法对基组的敏感性。在计算近似轨道与精确轨道的重叠时，只包含角动量不超过 *\\ lmax-1* 的基函数。例如，\\ "
"``MAXANG=2`` 表示省略所有 :math:`d`\\ 、\\ :math:`f` 及更高角动量函数的贡献。为获得合理的域，通常必须降低 "
"``THRBP`` 的值（降至 0.97 左右）。应谨慎使用此选项！"

msgid ""
"**``PIPEKAO``\\ =\\ *option*** If *option*\\ :math:`\\ge 0`, the orbitals "
"are localized my maximizing the coefficients of basis functions of a given "
"type at a given atom. Normally, this is only useful to uniquely define "
"degenerate orbitals in atoms. For instance, when this option is used to "
"localize the orbitals for a dimer like (Ar)\\ :math:`_2` at a very long "
"distance, clean :math:`s`, :math:`p_x`, :math:`p_y`, and :math:`p_z` atomic "
"orbitals will be obtained. It is not recommended to use this option for "
"molecular calculations!"
msgstr ""
"**``PIPEKAO``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 如果 *\\ option*\\ :math:`\\ge 0`\\ "
"，通过最大化给定原子上给定类型基函数的系数来定域化轨道。通常，这仅用于唯一地定义原子中的简并轨道。例如，当使用此选项为像 (Ar)\\ "
":math:`_2` 这样距离很长的二聚体定域化轨道时，将获得纯净的 :math:`s`\\ 、\\ :math:`p_x`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`p_y` 和 :math:`p_z` 原子轨道。不建议在分子计算中使用此选项！"

msgid ""
"**``NONORM``\\ =\\ *value*** Determines if projected functions are "
"normalized (not recommended). *value*\\ =-1: projected orbitals are "
"normalized before redundancy check."
msgstr ""
"**``NONORM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 确定投影函数是否归一化（不推荐）。*\\ value*\\ "
"=-1：投影轨道在冗余检查之前归一化。"

msgid ""
"*value*\\ =0: projected orbitals are normalized after redundancy check "
"(default). *value*\\ =1: projected orbitals are normalized in redundancy "
"check, afterwards unnormalized. *value*\\ =2: projected orbitals are never "
"normalized (default in gradient calculations)."
msgstr ""
"*value*\\ =0：投影轨道在冗余检查之后归一化（默认）。\\ *value*\\ =1：投影轨道在冗余检查中归一化，之后不归一化。\\ "
"*value*\\ =2：投影轨道从不归一化（梯度计算中的默认值）。"

msgid ""
"**``LMP2ALGO``\\ =\\ *value*** If nonzero, use low-order scaling method in "
"LMP2 iterations. Values can be 1, 2, or 3, and 3 is usually fastest if large"
" basis sets are used."
msgstr ""
"**``LMP2ALGO``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 如果非零，在 LMP2 迭代中使用低阶标度方法。取值可为 1、2 或 "
"3；如果使用大基组，3 通常最快。"

msgid ""
"**``OLDDEF``\\ =\\ *value*** For compatibility with older versions: if "
"nonzero, revert to old defaults. Options set before this may be overwritten."
msgstr "**``OLDDEF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 为兼容旧版本：如果非零，恢复旧的默认值。在此之前设置的选项可能被覆盖。"

msgid "**\\*\\*Thresholds:**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*阈值：**\\*\\*"

msgid ""
"**``THRPIP``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Threshold for Pipek-Mezey or Boys "
"localization. The localization is assumed to be converged if all :math:`2 "
"\\times 2` rotation angles are smaller than *thresh*. The default is "
":math:`1.d-9`. It can also be modified globally using ``GTHRESH, LOCALI=``\\"
" *thresh*."
msgstr ""
"**``THRPIP``\\ =\\ *\\ thresh*** Pipek-Mezey 或 Boys 定域化的阈值。如果所有 :math:`2 "
"\\times 2` 旋转角都小于 *\\ thresh\\ *，则认为定域化已收敛。默认值为 :math:`1.d-9`。也可使用 "
"``GTHRESH, LOCALI=``\\ *\\ thresh* 全局修改。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCPL``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Threshold for coupled perturbed localization "
"(default 1.d-9). This is only needed in local gradient calculations."
msgstr "**``THRCPL``\\ =\\ *\\ thresh*** 耦合微扰定域化的阈值（默认 1.d-9）。仅在局域梯度计算中需要。"

msgid ""
"**``THRORB``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Threshold for eliminating functions from pair "
"domains whose norm is smaller than *thresh* after projecting out the "
"occupied space. The default is *throrb=1.d-6*."
msgstr ""
"**``THRORB``\\ =\\ *\\ thresh*** 消除对域中投影掉占据空间后范数小于 *\\ thresh\\ * "
"的函数的阈值。默认值为 *\\ throrb=1.d-6*。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Threshold for eliminating redundant basis "
"functions from pair domains. For each eigenvalue of :math:`{\\bf \\tilde "
"S}^{ij} \\lt thresh` one function is deleted. The default is 1.d-6. The "
"method used for deleting functions depends on the parameters ``IDLEIG`` and "
"``IBASO``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *\\ thresh*** 从对域中消除冗余基函数的阈值。对于每个满足 :math:`{\\bf \\tilde "
"S}^{ij} \\lt thresh` 的特征值，删除一个函数。默认值为 1.d-6。删除函数所使用的方法取决于参数 ``IDLEIG`` 和 "
"``IBASO``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``THRMP2``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Threshold for neglecting small fock matrix "
"couplings in the LMP2 iterations (default 1.d-8). Specifying a larger "
"threshold speeds up the iterations but may lead to small errors in the "
"energy. In the initial iterations, a larger threshold is chosen "
"automatically. It is gradually reduced to the specified final value during "
"the iterations."
msgstr ""
"**``THRMP2``\\ =\\ *\\ thresh*** 在 LMP2 迭代中忽略小 Fock 矩阵耦合的阈值（默认 "
"1.d-8）。指定较大的阈值可加速迭代，但可能在能量中引入小误差。在初始迭代中会自动选择较大的阈值，并在迭代过程中逐渐降低至指定的最终值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRCOR``\\ =\\ *thresh*** Threshold for deleting projected core "
"orbitals. The functions are only deleted if their norm is smaller than "
"*thresh* (default 0.1)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``THRBP``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for selecting the atoms contributing "
"to orbital domains using the method of Boughton and Pulay (BP). As many "
"atoms as needed to fulfill the BP criterion are included in a domain. The "
"order in which atoms are considered depends on the parameter ``MAXBP``, see "
"below. The default is ``THRBP=0.98``. ``THRBP=1.0`` includes all atoms into "
"each orbital domain, i.e., leads to full domains. If no pairs are neglected,"
" this should yield the canonical MP2 energy. The criterion is somewhat basis"
" dependent. See section `orbital domains <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#orbital-domains>`__ for recommended "
"values of this threshold."
msgstr ""
"**``THRBP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 使用 Boughton 和 "
"Pulay（BP）方法选择对轨道域有贡献的原子的阈值。将包含满足 BP 判据所需的尽可能多的原子到域中。考虑原子的顺序取决于参数 ``MAXBP``\\"
" ，见下文。默认值为 ``THRBP=0.98``\\ 。\\ ``THRBP=1.0`` "
"将所有原子包含到每个轨道域中，即导致完全域。如果没有忽略任何对，这应给出正则 MP2 能量。该判据在某种程度上依赖于基组。关于此阈值的推荐值，请参见 "
"`orbital domains <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#orbital-"
"domains>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``CHGMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** determines the minimum allowed Mulliken (or "
"Löwdin) charge for an atom (except H) in a domain, i.e., atoms with a "
"smaller (absolute) charge are not included, even if the ``THRBP`` criterion "
"is not fulfilled (default 0.01)."
msgstr ""
"**``CHGMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 确定域中原子（H 除外）允许的最小 Mulliken（或 "
"Löwdin）电荷，即（绝对值）电荷更小的原子即使不满足 ``THRBP`` 判据也不包含在内（默认 0.01）。"

msgid ""
"**``CHGMINH``\\ =\\ *value*** as ``CHGMIN``, but used for H-atoms (default "
"0.03)."
msgstr "**``CHGMINH``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 与 ``CHGMIN`` 相同，但用于 H 原子（默认 0.03）。"

msgid ""
"**``CHGMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** If the atomic charge is larger than this value,"
" the atom is included, independent of any ranking."
msgstr "**``CHGMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 如果原子电荷大于此值，则不论任何排序都包含该原子。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXBP``\\ =\\ *maxbp*** If *maxbp=1*, the atoms are ranked according to "
"their contribution to the Boughton-Pulay overlap. If *maxbp=0* (default), "
"the atoms are ranked according to atomic charges. In both cases atoms with "
"charges greater than ``CHGMAX`` are always included, and atoms with the same"
" charges are added as groups."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``MULLIKEN``\\ =\\ *option*** Determines the method to determine atomic "
"charges. ``MULLIKEN=0`` (default): squares of diagonal elements of "
":math:`{\\bf S}^{\\frac{1}{2}} {\\bf C}` are used (Löwdin charges); "
"``MULLIKEN=1``: Mulliken gross charges are used. The first choice is less "
"basis set dependent and more reliable with diffuse basis sets."
msgstr ""
"**``MULLIKEN``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 确定计算原子电荷的方法。\\ ``MULLIKEN=0``\\ （默认）：使用 "
":math:`{\\bf S}^{\\frac{1}{2}} {\\bf C}` 对角元的平方（Löwdin 电荷）；\\ "
"``MULLIKEN=1``\\ ：使用 Mulliken 总电荷。前者对基组依赖性较小，且对弥散基组更可靠。"

msgid ""
"**``MERGEDOM``\\ =\\ *number*** If *number* is greater than zero, all "
"orbital domains containing *number* or more atoms in common are merged "
"(*number=1* is treated as *number=2*, default 0). This is particularly "
"useful for geometry optimizations of conjugated or aromatic systems like, "
"e.g., benzene. In the latter case, ``MERGEDOM=1`` causes the generation of "
"full :math:`\\pi`-domains, i.e., the domains for all three "
":math:`\\pi`-orbitals comprise all carbon basis functions. Note that the "
"merged domains are generated after the above print of orbital domains, and "
"information about merged domains is printed separately. See section "
"`gradients and frequency calculations <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#gradients-and-frequency-"
"calculations>`__ for further discussion of geometry optimizations."
msgstr ""
"**``MERGEDOM``\\ =\\ *\\ number*** 如果 *\\ number\\ * 大于零，则合并所有包含 *\\ "
"number\\ * 个或更多共同原子的轨道域（*\\ number=1\\ * 按 *\\ number=2* 处理，默认 "
"0）。这对于共轭或芳香体系（例如苯）的几何优化特别有用。在后一种情况下，\\ ``MERGEDOM=1`` 会生成完全的 :math:`\\pi` "
"域，即所有三个 :math:`\\pi` "
"轨道的域都包含全部碳基函数。请注意，合并后的域是在上述轨道域打印之后生成的，关于合并域的信息单独打印。关于几何优化的进一步讨论，请参见 "
"`gradients and frequency calculations <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#gradients-and-frequency-"
"calculations>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"This parameter determines the method for eliminating redundant functions of "
"pair domains. *ibaso=0*: The space of normalized eigenvectors of "
":math:`{\\bf \\tilde S}^{ij}`, which correspond to small eigenvalues, is "
"eliminated (default). Any other value is not recommended and not further "
"documented."
msgstr ""
"此参数确定消除对域中冗余函数的方法。\\ *ibaso=0*\\ ：消除 :math:`{\\bf \\tilde S}^{ij}` "
"中对应小特征值的归一化特征向量所张成的空间（默认）。不建议使用任何其他值，也不作进一步说明。"

msgid ""
"**``REXT``\\ =\\ *value*** Distance criterion for extension of all pair "
"domains."
msgstr "**``REXT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 扩展所有对域的距离判据。"

msgid ""
"**``REXTS``\\ =\\ *value*** Distance criterion for extension of strong pair "
"domains."
msgstr "**``REXTS``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 扩展强对域的距离判据。"

msgid ""
"**``REXTC``\\ =\\ *value*** Distance criterion for extension of strong and "
"close pair domains."
msgstr "**``REXTC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 扩展强对和近对域的距离判据。"

msgid ""
"**``REXTW``\\ =\\ *value*** Distance criterion for extension of strong, "
"close, and weak pair domains."
msgstr "**``REXTW``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 扩展强对、近对和弱对域的距离判据。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXT``\\ =\\ *value*** Connectivity criterion for extension of all pair "
"domains."
msgstr "**``IEXT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 所有对域扩展的连通性判据。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXTS``\\ =\\ *value*** Connectivity criterion for extension of strong "
"pair domains."
msgstr "**``IEXTS``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 强对域扩展的连通性判据。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXTC``\\ =\\ *value*** Connectivity criterion for extension of strong "
"and close pair domains."
msgstr "**``IEXTC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 强对和近对域扩展的连通性判据。"

msgid ""
"**``IEXTW``\\ =\\ *value*** Connectivity criterion for extension of strong, "
"close, and weak pair domains."
msgstr "**``IEXTW``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 强对、近对和弱对域扩展的连通性判据。"

msgid "``DOMAIN,orbital,atom1, atom2 …``"
msgstr "``DOMAIN,orbital,atom1, atom2 …``"

msgid "``LOCAL,MULTP,options``"
msgstr "``LOCAL,MULTP,options``"

msgid "``MULTP,options``"
msgstr "``MULTP,options``"

msgid "``SAVE,record``"
msgstr "``SAVE,record``"

