msgstr "``ENEPART,[epart],[iepart]``"

msgid "``ENEPART,RMAX=[r1,r2,r3,…]``"
msgstr "``ENEPART,RMAX=[r1,r2,r3,…]``"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`Split Coulomb operator treatment (ATTENUATE) "
"<split_coulomb_operator_treatment_attenuate>`."
msgstr ""
"参见\\ "
":doc:`拆分库仑算符处理（ATTENUATE）<split_coulomb_operator_treatment_attenuate>`\\ 。"

msgid "``PIPEK,DELETE=$n$``"
msgstr "``PIPEK,DELETE=$n$``"

msgid "``PIPEK,METHOD=2,[DELETE=$n$]``"
msgstr "``PIPEK,METHOD=2,[DELETE=$n$]``"

msgid "``PIPEK,METHOD=3,[DELETE=$n$]``"
msgstr "``PIPEK,METHOD=3,[DELETE=$n$]``"

msgid ""
"Geometry optimizations [15-17] and numerical frequency calculations [18-20] "
"can be performed using analytical energy gradients [15-17] for local MP2. "
"LMP2 geometry optimizations are particularly attractive for weakly bound "
"systems, since virtually BSSE free structures are obtained (see section "
"`intermolecular interactions <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__ and "
"Refs. [21-23]). For reasons of efficiency it is strongly advisable to use "
"the DF-LMP2 Gradient [17] for all geometry optimizations. Setting "
"``SCSGRD=1`` on the ``DF-LMP2`` command or ``DFIT`` directive activates the "
"gradient with respect to Grimme's SCS scaled MP2 energy functional (see also"
" section DFIT). Analytical energy gradients are not yet available for the "
"multipole approximation of distant pairs, and therefore ``MULTP`` cannot be "
"used in geometry optimizations or frequency calculations."
msgstr ""
"利用局域 MP2 的解析能量梯度 [15-17]，可以进行几何优化 [15-17] 和数值频率计算 [18-20]。LMP2 "
"几何优化对于弱束缚体系尤其有吸引力，因为可以获得几乎无 BSSE 的结构（见 `分子间相互作用 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__ "
"一节和文献 [21-23]）。出于效率考虑，强烈建议在所有几何优化中使用 DF-LMP2 梯度 [17]。在 ``DF-LMP2`` 命令或 "
"``DFIT`` 指令上设置 ``SCSGRD=1`` 可激活相对于 Grimme SCS 标度 MP2 能量泛函的梯度（另见 DFIT "
"一节）。解析能量梯度尚不适用于远对的多极近似，因此 ``MULTP`` 不能用于几何优化或频率计算。"

msgid ""
"A final warning concerns local density fitting (see sections `Density-fitted"
" LMP2 (DF-LMP2), LDCSD (DF-LDCSD), and coupled cluster (DF-LCCSD(T0)) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#density-fitted-lmp2-df-lmp2-ldcsd-"
"df-ldcsd-and-coupled-cluster-df-lccsd-t0>`__ and :doc:`density fitting "
"<density_fitting>`): local fitting must not be used in counterpoise "
"calculations, since no fitting functions would be present on the dummy atoms"
" and this can lead to large errors."
msgstr ""
"最后一点警告涉及局域密度拟合（见 `密度拟合 LMP2 (DF-LMP2)、LDCSD (DF-LDCSD) 和耦合簇 (DF-LCCSD(T0)) "
"<pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#density-fitted-lmp2-df-"
"lmp2-ldcsd-df-ldcsd-and-coupled-cluster-df-lccsd-t0>`__ 一节以及 :doc:`密度拟合 "
"<density_fitting>`\\ ）：局域拟合不得用于均衡校正计算，因为哑原子上不会存在拟合函数，这可能导致较大误差。"

msgid ""
"As discussed above, efficient LCCSD(T) calculations employ a hierarchical "
"treatment of the LMO pairs, which are distinguished into the pair classes "
"*strong*, *close*, *weak*, and *very distant*. Only the strong pairs are "
"actually treated at the full coupled cluster level, while for close and weak"
" pairs only LMP2 is used (and very distant pairs are omitted altogether). "
"Consequently, *intermolecular pairs* in bigger molecules or clusters, which "
"are usually not strong, are only treated at the LMP2 level, which is often "
"poor (since van der Waals interactions are only captured at the lowest level"
" of perturbation theory) and compromises the otherwise high accuracy of "
"coupled cluster like LCCSD(T). By setting the keyword ``how_treatclswk`` on "
"the ``local`` card appropriately, it is possible to treat the close pairs at"
" a higher level than LMP2, *i.e.*,"
msgstr ""
"如上所述，高效的 LCCSD(T) 计算采用对 LMO 对的分层处理，这些对儿被区分为\\ *强对*\\ 、\\ *近对*\\ 、\\ *弱对*\\ "
"和\\ *极远对*\\ 等对儿类别。只有强对真正在完整耦合簇水平上处理，而对于近对和弱对仅使用 "
"LMP2（极远对则完全省略）。因此，较大分子或团簇中的\\ *分子间对*\\ 通常不是强对，仅在 LMP2 "
"水平上处理，而该水平往往较差（因为范德华相互作用仅在最低阶微扰理论水平上被捕获），从而损害了 LCCSD(T) 这类耦合簇方法本应具有的高精度。通过在 "
"``local`` 卡片上适当设置关键字 ``how_treatclswk``\\ ，可以用高于 LMP2 的水平处理近对，\\ *即*\\ ，"

msgid "``how_treatclswk=1`` local MP2"
msgstr "``how_treatclswk=1`` 局域 MP2"

msgid "``how_treatclswk=2`` direct local RPA"
msgstr "``how_treatclswk=2`` 直接局域 RPA"

msgid "``how_treatclswk=3`` local ring-CCD3"
msgstr "``how_treatclswk=3`` 局域 ring-CCD3"

msgid "``how_treatclswk=4`` local ring-CCD"
msgstr "``how_treatclswk=4`` 局域 ring-CCD"

msgid "``how_treatclswk=5`` local CCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}`"
msgstr "``how_treatclswk=5`` 局域 CCD[S]-R\\ :math:`^{-6}`"

msgid ""
"See also the input example `h2o_dimer_lccsdhybrids.inp "
"<media/examples/h2o_dimer_lccsdhybrids.inp>`__."
msgstr ""
"另见输入示例 `h2o_dimer_lccsdhybrids.inp "
"<media/examples/h2o_dimer_lccsdhybrids.inp>`__\\ 。"

msgid "``DF-LMP2,[options]\\\\`` ``DF-LCCSD(T),[options]``"
msgstr "``DF-LMP2,[options]\\\\`` ``DF-LCCSD(T),[options]``"

msgid ""
"Options for density fitting can be mixed with any options for ``LOCAL``. "
"Options for density fitting can also be given on a ``DFIT`` directive (see "
"section :doc:`density fitting <density_fitting>`)."
msgstr ""
"密度拟合的选项可以与 ``LOCAL`` 的任何选项混合使用。密度拟合的选项也可以在 ``DFIT`` 指令上给出（见 :doc:`密度拟合 "
"<density_fitting>` 一节）。"

msgid ""
"**``BASIS_MP2``\\ =\\ *string*** Fitting basis set used in LMP2 and in LCCSD"
" for integrals with up to 2 external orbitals. If a correlation consistent "
"basis set is used (e.g. cc-pVTZ) the corresponding fitting basis for MP2 us "
"used by default (cc-pVTZ/MP2FIT). Otherwise the fitting basis set must be "
"defined in a preceding basis block (see section :doc:`basis input "
"<basis_input>`)."
msgstr ""
"**``BASIS_MP2``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于 LMP2 和 LCCSD 中涉及至多 2 "
"个外部轨道积分的拟合基组。如果使用相关一致基组（例如 cc-pVTZ），则默认使用相应的 MP2 拟合基组（cc-"
"pVTZ/MP2FIT）。否则，拟合基组必须在之前的基组块中定义（见 :doc:`基组输入 <basis_input>` 一节）。"

msgid ""
"**``BASIS_CCSD``\\ =\\ *string*** Fitting basis set used in LCCSD for "
"integrals over 3- and 4-external orbitals. The default is ``BASIS_MP2`` and "
"this is usually sufficient. However, the accurate approximation of "
"4-external integrals in LCCSD requires larger fitting basis sets than LMP2. "
"Therefore, in order to minimize fitting errors, it is recommended to use the"
" next larger fitting basis, e.g., ``BASIS_CCSD=VQZ`` for orbital basis "
"``VTZ``."
msgstr ""
"**``BASIS_CCSD``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 用于 LCCSD 中涉及 3-外部和 4-外部轨道积分的拟合基组。默认为 "
"``BASIS_MP2``\\ ，这通常已足够。然而，在 LCCSD 中精确近似 4-外部积分需要比 LMP2 "
"更大的拟合基组。因此，为了最小化拟合误差，建议使用下一个更大的拟合基组，例如对于轨道基组 ``VTZ`` 使用 ``BASIS_CCSD=VQZ``\\"
" 。"

msgid ""
"**``LOCFIT``\\ =\\ *value*:** If ``LOCFIT=1`` local fitting is enabled. This"
" is necessary to achieve linear scaling in DF-LMP2 (see Refs. [11-14]). The "
"errors introduced by local fitting are usually very small, but there are "
"some exceptions. For instance, ``LOCFIT=1`` must not be used in counterpoise"
" calculations, see section `intermolecular interactions <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__) "
"Note that for small molecules ``LOCFIT=1`` can be more expensive than "
"``LOCFIT=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``LOCFIT``\\ =\\ *\\ value\\ *：** 若 ``LOCFIT=1`` 则启用局部拟合。这是在 DF-LMP2 "
"中实现线性标度所必需的（参见参考文献 [11-14]）。由局部拟合引入的误差通常非常小，但也存在一些例外。例如，在均衡校正计算中不得使用 "
"``LOCFIT=1``\\ ，参见 `分子间相互作用 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#intermolecular-interactions>`__ "
"一节。请注意，对于小分子，\\ ``LOCFIT=1`` 可能比 ``LOCFIT=0`` 开销更大。"

msgid ""
"For further details and options for density fitting see section "
":doc:`density fitting <density_fitting>`."
msgstr "有关密度拟合的更多细节和选项，参见 :doc:`密度拟合 <density_fitting>` 一节。"
